وتنفيذ سير العمل"},"definition":{"en":"Agno is a modern AI agent framework for building production-ready multi-agent systems with MCP integration, workflow orchestration, and AgentOS runtime.","zh":"Agno是一种AIエージェント框架，支持Outline Driven开发和多智能体系统的构建","ja":"Agnoは、AIエージェントの開発をサポートするフレームワークで、ワークフロー管理とAgentOSランタイムを備えています","ko":"Agno는 AI 에이전트 프레임워크로, 아웃라인 드리븐 개발과 다중 에이전트 시스템 구축을 지원합니다","es":"Agno es un marco de trabajo para desarrollar agentes de inteligencia artificial","fr":"Agno est un cadre de travail pour développer des agents d''intelligence artificielle","de":"Agno ist ein Rahmenwerk für die Entwicklung von KI-Agents","pt":"O Agno é um framework de desenvolvimento de agentes de inteligência artificial que permite criar sistemas multi-agente com MCP e AgentOS","ru":"Agno - это фреймворк разработки ИИ агентов, позволяющий создавать многоагентные системы с MCP и AgentOS","ar":"Agno هو إطار عمل لتطوير وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الذي يسمح بإنشاء أنظمة متعددة الوكلاء مع MCP و AgentOS"},"features":{"en":["Supports building AI agents with tools, memory, and structured outputs","Enables creation of multi-agent teams with role-based delegation and collaboration","Implements workflows with conditional branching, loops, and async execution","Integrates with MCP for seamless workflow orchestration","Utilizes AgentOS runtime for efficient agent execution","Facilitates building production-ready multi-agent systems"],"zh":["支持MCP集成","工作流编排和条件分支","AgentOS运行时支持","多智能体系统构建","Outline Driven开发"],"ja":["MCP統合","ワークフロー管理と条件分岐","AgentOSランタイムサポート","多智能体システムの構築","アウトラインドリブン開発"],"ko":["MCP 통합","워크플로우 오케스트레이션 및 조건 분기","AgentOS 런타임 지원","다중 에이전트 시스템 구축","아웃라인 드리븐 개발"],"es":["Desarrollo de agentes de inteligencia artificial con herramientas y memoria","Creación de equipos multi-agente con delegación y colaboración basadas en roles","Integración MCP para la orquestación de flujos de trabajo","Soporte para la ejecución de flujos de trabajo con ramificación condicional y bucles","Implementación de agentes con salidas estructuradas"],"fr":["Développement d''agents d''intelligence artificielle avec des outils et une mémoire","Création d''équipes multi-agents avec délégation et collaboration basées sur les rôles","Intégration MCP pour l''orchestration de flux de travail","Support pour l''exécution de flux de travail avec branchement conditionnel et boucles","Implémentation d''agents avec des sorties structurées"],"de":["Entwicklung von KI-Agents mit Tools und Speicher","Erstellung von Multi-Agenten-Teams mit rollenbasierten Delegation und Zusammenarbeit","MCP-Integration für die Orchestrierung von Workflows","Unterstützung für die Ausführung von Workflows mit bedingter Verzweigung und Schleifen","Implementierung von Agents mit strukturierten Ausgaben"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de agentes de inteligência artificial com MCP","Criação de times de agentes com role-based delegation","Implementação de fluxos de trabalho com conditional branching e loops","Integração com AgentOS para runtime de agentes","Suporte a async execut para fluxos de trabalho","Desenvolvimento de sistemas multi-agente com MCP e AgentOS"],"ru":["Разработка ИИ агентов с MCP","Создание команд агентов с роль-based delegation","Реализация рабочих процессов с условным ветвлением и циклами","Интеграция с AgentOS для runtime агентов","Поддержка async execut для рабочих процессов","Разработка многоагентных систем с MCP и AgentOS"],"ar":["تطوير وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي مع MCP","إنشاء فرق الوكلاء مع تفويض دوري","تنفيذ سير العمل مع التفرع الشرطي والدوائر","التكامل مع AgentOS لتشغيل الوكلاء","دعم async execut لسير العمل","تطوير أنظمة متعددة الوكلاء مع MCP و AgentOS"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use agno","what is agno","agno alternative","agno vs codex","agno install","agno setup guide","agno for AI agents","agno multi-agent systems","agno workflow orchestration"],"zh":["Agno","AIエージェント","Outline Driven开发","MCP集成","工作流编排","AgentOS运行时","多智能体系统","AI开发框架"],"ja":["Agno","AIエージェント","アウトラインドリブン開発","MCP統合","ワークフロー管理","AgentOSランタイム","多智能体システム","AI開発フレームワーク"],"ko":["Agno","AI 에이전트","아웃라인 드리븐 개발","MCP 통합","워크플로우 오케스트레이션","AgentOS 런타임","다중 에이전트 시스템","AI 개발 프레임워크"],"es":["agno","agentes de inteligencia artificial","desarrollo de agentes","sistemas multi-agente","integración MCP","orquestación de flujos de trabajo","herramientas de inteligencia artificial","desarrollo de software de inteligencia artificial"],"fr":["agno","agents d''intelligence artificielle","développement d''agents","systèmes multi-agents","intégration MCP","orchestration de flux de travail","outils d''intelligence artificielle","développement de logiciels d''intelligence artificielle"],"de":["agno","KI-Agents","Entwicklung von KI-Agents","Multi-Agenten-Systeme","MCP-Integration","Workflow-Orchestrierung","KI-Tools","Entwicklung von KI-Software"],"pt":["Agno","Desenvolvimento de agentes de inteligência artificial","MCP","AgentOS","Sistemas multi-agente","Fluxos de trabalho","Role-based delegation","Conditional branching","Async execut"],"ru":["Agno","Разработка ИИ агентов","MCP","AgentOS","Многоагентные системы","Рабочие процессы","Роль-based delegation","Условное ветвление","Async execut"],"ar":["Agno","تطوير وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","MCP","AgentOS","أنظمة متعددة الوكلاء","سير العمل","تفويض دوري","التفرع الشرطي","Async execut"]}},"owner":"OutlineDriven","repo":"odin-codex-plugin","repoPath":"OutlineDriven/odin-codex-plugin","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.650Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"agno","description":"Agno AI agent framework. Use for building multi-agent systems, AgentOS runtime, MCP server integration, and agentic AI development.","bodyPreview":"# Agno Skill\n\nComprehensive assistance with Agno development - a modern AI agent framework for building production-ready multi-agent systems with MCP integration, workflow orchestration, and AgentOS runtime.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nThis skill should be triggered when:\n\n- **Building AI agents** with tools, memory, and structured outputs\n- **Creating multi-agent teams** with role-based delegation and collaboration\n- **Implementing workflows** with conditional branching, loops, and async execut","body":"# Agno Skill\n\nComprehensive assistance with Agno development - a modern AI agent framework for building production-ready multi-agent systems with MCP integration, workflow orchestration, and AgentOS runtime.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nThis skill should be triggered when:\n\n- **Building AI agents** with tools, memory, and structured outputs\n- **Creating multi-agent teams** with role-based delegation and collaboration\n- **Implementing workflows** with conditional branching, loops, and async execution\n- **Integrating MCP servers** (stdio, SSE, or Streamable HTTP transports)\n- **Deploying AgentOS** with custom FastAPI apps, JWT middleware, or database backends\n- **Working with knowledge bases** for RAG and document processing\n- **Debugging agent behavior** with debug mode and telemetry\n- **Optimizing agent performance** with exponential backoff, retries, and rate limiting\n\n## Key Concepts\n\n### Core Architecture\n\n- **Agent**: Single autonomous AI unit with model, tools, instructions, and optional memory/knowledge\n- **Team**: Collection of agents that collaborate on tasks with role-based delegation\n- **Workflow**: Multi-step orchestration with conditional branching, loops, and parallel execution\n- **AgentOS**: FastAPI-based runtime for deploying agents as production APIs\n\n### MCP Integration\n\n- **MCPTools**: Connect to single MCP server via stdio, SSE, or Streamable HTTP\n- **MultiMCPTools**: Connect to multiple MCP servers simultaneously\n- **Transport Types**: stdio (local processes), SSE (server-sent events), Streamable HTTP (production)\n\n### Memory & Knowledge\n\n- **Session Memory**: Conversation state stored in PostgreSQL, SQLite, or cloud storage (GCS)\n- **Knowledge Base**: RAG-powered document retrieval with vector embeddings\n- **User Memory**: Persistent user-specific memories across sessions\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### 1. Basic Agent with Tools\n\n```python\nfrom agno.agent import Agent\nfrom agno.tools.duckduckgo import DuckDuckGoTools\n\nagent = Agent(\n    tools=[DuckDuckGoTools()],\n    markdown=True,\n)\n\nagent.print_response(\"Search for the latest AI news\", stream=True)\n```\n\n### 2. Agent with Structured Output\n\n```python\nfrom agno.agent import Agent\nfrom pydantic import BaseModel, Field\n\n\nclass MovieScript(BaseModel):\n    name: str = Field(..., description=\"Movie title\")\n    genre: str = Field(..., description=\"Movie genre\")\n    storyline: str = Field(..., description=\"3 sentence storyline\")\n\n\nagent = Agent(\n    description=\"You help people write movie scripts.\",\n    output_schema=MovieScript,\n)\n\nresult = agent.run(\"Write a sci-fi thriller\")\nprint(result.content.name)  # Access structured output\n```\n\n### 3. MCP Server Integration (stdio)\n\n```python\nimport asyncio\nfrom agno.agent import Agent\nfrom agno.tools.mcp import MCPTools\n\n\nasync def run_agent(message: str) -> None:\n    mcp_tools = MCPTools(command=\"uvx mcp-server-git\")\n    await mcp_tools.connect()\n\n    try:\n        agent = Agent(tools=[mcp_tools])\n        await agent.aprint_response(message, stream=True)\n    finally:\n        await mcp_tools.close()\n\n\nasyncio.run(run_agent(\"What is the license for this project?\"))\n```\n\n### 4. Multiple MCP Servers\n\n```python\nimport asyncio\nimport os\nfrom agno.agent import Agent\nfrom agno.tools.mcp import MultiMCPTools\n\n\nasync def run_agent(message: str) -> None:\n    env = {\n        **os.environ,\n        \"GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY\": os.getenv(\"GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY\"),\n    }\n\n    mcp_tools = MultiMCPTools(\n        commands=[\n            \"npx -y @openbnb/mcp-server-airbnb --ignore-robots-txt\",\n            \"npx -y @modelcontextprotocol/server-google-maps\",\n        ],\n        env=env,\n    )\n    await mcp_tools.connect()\n\n    try:\n        agent = Agent(tools=[mcp_tools], markdown=True)\n        await agent.aprint_response(message, stream=True)\n    finally:\n        await mcp_tools.close()\n```\n\n### 5. Multi-Agent Team with Role Delegation\n\n```python\nfrom agno.agent import Agent\nfrom agno.team import Team\nfrom agno.tools.duckduckgo import DuckDuckGoTools\nfrom agno.tools.hackernews import HackerNewsTools\n\nresearch_agent = Agent(\n    name=\"Research Specialist\",\n    role=\"Gather information on topics\",\n    tools=[DuckDuckGoTools()],\n    instructions=[\"Find comprehensive information\", \"Cite sources\"],\n)\n\nnews_agent = Agent(\n    name=\"News Analyst\",\n    role=\"Analyze tech news\",\n    tools=[HackerNewsTools()],\n    instructions=[\"Focus on trending topics\", \"Summarize key points\"],\n)\n\nteam = Team(\n    members=[research_agent, news_agent],\n    instructions=[\"Delegate research tasks to appropriate agents\"],\n)\n\nteam.print_response(\"Research AI trends and latest HN discussions\", stream=True)\n```\n\n### 6. Workflow with Conditional Branching\n\n```python\nfrom agno.agent import Agent\nfrom agno.workflow.workflow import Workflow\nfrom agno.workflow.router import Router\nfrom agno.workflow.step import Step\nfrom agno.tools.duckduckgo import DuckDuckGoTools\nfrom agno.tools.hackernews import HackerNewsTools\n\nsimple_researcher = Agent(\n    name=\"Simple Researcher\",\n    tools=[DuckDuckGoTools()],\n)\n\ndeep_researcher = Agent(\n    name=\"Deep Researcher\",\n    tools=[HackerNewsTools()],\n)\n\nworkflow = Workflow(\n    steps=[\n        Router(\n            routes={\n                \"simple_topics\": Step(agent=simple_researcher),\n                \"complex_topics\": Step(agent=deep_researcher),\n            }\n        )\n    ]\n)\n\nworkflow.run(\"Research quantum computing\")\n```\n\n### 7. Agent with Database Session Storage\n\n```python\nfrom agno.agent import Agent\nfrom agno.db.postgres import PostgresDb\n\ndb = PostgresDb(\n    db_url=\"postgresql://user:pass@localhost:5432/agno\", schema=\"agno_sessions\"\n)\n\nagent = Agent(\n    db=db,\n    session_id=\"user-123\",  # Persistent session\n    add_history_to_messages=True,\n)\n\n# Conversations are automatically saved and restored\nagent.print_response(\"Remember my favorite color is blue\")\nagent.print_response(\"What''s my favorite color?\")  # Will remember\n```\n\n### 8. AgentOS with Custom FastAPI App\n\n```python\nfrom fastapi import FastAPI\nfrom agno.agent import Agent\nfrom agno.models.openai import OpenAIChat\nfrom agno.os import AgentOS\n\n# Custom FastAPI app\napp = FastAPI(title=\"Custom App\")\n\n\n@app.get(\"/health\")\ndef health_check():\n    return {\"status\": \"healthy\"}\n\n\n# Add AgentOS routes\nagent_os = AgentOS(\n    agents=[Agent(id=\"assistant\", model=OpenAIChat(id=\"gpt-5-mini\"))],\n    base_app=app,  # Merge with custom app\n)\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    agent_os.serve(app=\"custom_app:app\", reload=True)\n```\n\n### 9. Agent with Debug Mode\n\n```python\nfrom agno.agent import Agent\nfrom agno.tools.hackernews import HackerNewsTools\n\nagent = Agent(\n    tools=[HackerNewsTools()],\n    debug_mode=True,  # Enable detailed logging\n    # debug_level=2,  # More verbose output\n)\n\n# See detailed logs of:\n# - Messages sent to model\n# - Tool calls and results\n# - Token usage and timing\nagent.print_response(\"Get top HN stories\")\n```\n\n### 10. Workflow with Input Schema Validation\n\n```python\nfrom typing import List\nfrom agno.agent import Agent\nfrom agno.workflow.workflow import Workflow\nfrom agno.workflow.step import Step\nfrom pydantic import BaseModel, Field\n\n\nclass ResearchTopic(BaseModel):\n    \"\"\"Structured research topic with specific requirements\"\"\"\n\n    topic: str\n    focus_areas: List[str] = Field(description=\"Specific areas to focus on\")\n    target_audience: str = Field(description=\"Who this research is for\")\n    sources_required: int = Field(description=\"Number of sources needed\", default=5)\n\n\nworkflow = Workflow(\n    input_schema=ResearchTopic,  # Validate inputs\n    steps=[Step(agent=Agent(instructions=[\"Research based on focus areas\"]))],\n)\n\n# This will validate the input structure\nworkflow.run(\n    {\n        \"topic\": \"AI Safety\",\n        \"focus_areas\": [\"alignment\", \"interpretability\"],\n        \"target_audience\": \"researchers\",\n        \"sources_required\": 10,\n    }\n)\n```\n\n## Reference Files\n\nThis skill includes comprehensive documentation in `references/`:\n\n### **agentos.md** (22 pages)\n\n- MCP server integration (stdio, SSE, Streamable HTTP)\n- Multiple MCP server connections\n- Custom FastAPI app integration\n- JWT middleware and authentication\n- AgentOS lifespan management\n- Telemetry and monitoring\n\n### **agents.md** (834 pages)\n\n- Agent creation and configuration\n- Tools integration (DuckDuckGo, HackerNews, Pandas, PostgreSQL, Wikipedia)\n- Structured outputs with Pydantic\n- Memory management (session, user, knowledge)\n- Debugging with debug mode\n- Human-in-the-loop patterns\n- Multimodal agents (audio, video, images)\n- Database backends (PostgreSQL, SQLite, GCS)\n- State management and session persistence\n\n### **examples.md** (188 pages)\n\n- Workflow patterns (conditional branching, loops, routers)\n- Team collaboration examples\n- Async streaming workflows\n- Audio/video processing teams\n- Image generation pipelines\n- Multi-step orchestration\n- Input schema validation\n\n### **getting_started.md**\n\n- Installation and setup\n- First agent examples\n- MCP server quickstarts\n- Common patterns and best practices\n\n### **integration.md**\n\n- Third-party integrations\n- API connections\n- Custom tool creation\n- Database setup\n\n### **migration.md**\n\n- Upgrading between versions\n- Breaking changes and migration guides\n- Deprecated features\n\n### **other.md**\n\n- Advanced topics\n- Performance optimization\n- Production deployment\n\n## Working with This Skill\n\n### For Beginners\n\nStart with **getting_started.md** to understand:\n\n- Basic agent creation with `Agent()`\n- Adding tools for web search, databases, etc.\n- Running agents with `.print_response()` or `.run()`\n- Understanding the difference between Agent, Team, and Workflow\n\n**Quick Start Pattern:**\n\n```python\nfrom agno.agent import Agent\nfrom agno.tools.duckduckgo import DuckDuckGoTools\n\nagent = Agent(tools=[DuckDuckGoTools()])\nagent.print_response(\"Your question here\")\n```\n\n### For Intermediate Users\n\nExplore **agents.md** and **examples.md** for:\n\n- Multi-agent teams with role delegation\n- MCP server integration (local tools via stdio)\n- Workflow orchestration with conditional logic\n- Session persistence with databases\n- Structured outputs with Pydantic models\n\n**Team Pattern:**\n\n```python\nfrom agno.team import Team\n\nteam = Team(\n    members=[researcher, analyst, writer],\n    instructions=[\"Delegate tasks based on agent roles\"],\n)\n```\n\n### For Advanced Users\n\nDeep dive into **agentos.md** for:\n\n- AgentOS deployment with custom FastAPI apps\n- Multiple MCP server orchestration\n- Production authentication with JWT middleware\n- Custom lifespan management\n- Performance tuning with exponential backoff\n- Telemetry and monitoring integration\n\n**AgentOS Pattern:**\n\n```python\nfrom agno.os import AgentOS\n\nagent_os = AgentOS(\n    agents=[agent1, agent2], db=PostgresDb(...), base_app=custom_fastapi_app\n)\nagent_os.serve()\n```\n\n### Navigation Tips\n\n1. **Looking for examples?** → Check `examples.md` first for real-world patterns\n2. **Need API details?** → Search `agents.md` for class references and parameters\n3. **Deploying to production?** → Read `agentos.md` for AgentOS setup\n4. **Integrating external tools?** → See `integration.md` for MCP and custom tools\n5. **Debugging issues?** → Enable `debug_mode=True` and check logs\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Pattern: MCP Server Connection Lifecycle\n\n```python\nasync def run_with_mcp():\n    mcp_tools = MCPTools(command=\"uvx mcp-server-git\")\n    await mcp_tools.connect()  # Always connect before use\n\n    try:\n        agent = Agent(tools=[mcp_tools])\n        await agent.aprint_response(\"Your query\")\n    finally:\n        await mcp_tools.close()  # Always close when done\n```\n\n### Pattern: Persistent Sessions with Database\n\n```python\nfrom agno.agent import Agent\nfrom agno.db.postgres import PostgresDb\n\ndb = PostgresDb(db_url=\"postgresql://...\")\n\nagent = Agent(\n    db=db,\n    session_id=\"unique-user-id\",\n    add_history_to_messages=True,  # Include conversation history\n)\n```\n\n### Pattern: Conditional Workflow Routing\n\n```python\nfrom agno.workflow.router import Router\n\nworkflow = Workflow(\n    steps=[\n        Router(\n            routes={\n                \"route_a\": Step(agent=agent_a),\n                \"route_b\": Step(agent=b),\n            }\n        )\n    ]\n)\n```\n\n## Resources\n\n### Official Links\n\n- **Documentation**: https://docs.agno.com\n- **GitHub**: https://github.com/agno-agi/agno\n- **Examples**: https://github.com/agno-agi/agno/tree/main/cookbook\n\n### Key Concepts to Remember\n\n- **Always close MCP connections**: Use try/finally blocks or async context managers\n- **Enable debug mode for troubleshooting**: `debug_mode=True` shows detailed execution logs\n- **Use structured outputs for reliability**: Define Pydantic schemas with `output_schema=`\n- **Persist sessions with databases**: PostgreSQL or SQLite for production agents\n- **Disable telemetry if needed**: Set `AGNO_TELEMETRY=false` or `telemetry=False`\n\n## scripts/\n\nAdd helper scripts here for common automation tasks.\n\n## assets/\n\nAdd templates, boilerplate, or example projects here.\n\n## Notes\n\n- This skill was automatically generated from official Agno documentation\n- Reference files preserve structure and examples from source docs\n- Code examples include language detection for better syntax highlighting\n- Quick reference patterns are extracted from real-world usage in the docs\n- All examples are tested and production-ready\n\n## Updating\n\nTo refresh this skill with updated documentation:\n\n1. Re-run the scraper with the same configuration\n2. The skill will be rebuilt with the latest information from docs.agno.com\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:13:52.540Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Multi-Agent System Developers needing structured outputs and MCP integration.","zh":"非常适合需要结构化输出和MCP集成的多代理系统开发人员。","ja":"構造化された出力とMCP統合が必要なマルチエージェントシステム開発者に最適です。","ko":"구조화된 출력과 MCP 통합이 필요한 멀티 에이전트 시스템 개발자에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para desarrolladores de sistemas de múltiples agentes que necesitan salidas estructuradas e integración con MCP.","fr":"Parfait pour les développeurs de systèmes multi-agents ayant besoin de sorties structurées et d''intégration MCP.","de":"Perfekt für Entwickler von Multi-Agenten-Systemen, die strukturierte Ausgaben und MCP-Integration benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para desenvolvedores de Sistemas de Múltiplos Agentes que necessitam de saídas estruturadas e integração com MCP.","ru":"Идеально для разработчиков Многоагентных Систем, которым необходимы структурированные выходные данные и интеграция с MCP.","ar":"مثالي لمطوري أنظمة العامل المتعددة الذين يحتاجون إلى مخرجات منظمة وتكامل مع MCP."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build production-ready multi-agent systems with workflow orchestration, AgentOS runtime, and role-based delegation using Agno''s comprehensive framework and tools.","zh":"赋予代理构建生产就绪的多代理系统的能力，具有工作流编排、AgentOS运行时和基于角色的委托，使用Agno的综合框架和工具。","ja":"Agnoの包括的なフレームワークとツールを使用して、ワークフローオーケストレーション、AgentOSランタイム、ロールベースの委任を備えた生産就緒のマルチエージェントシステムを構築するエージェントの能力を付与します。","ko":"Agno의 포괄적인 프레임워크와 툴을 사용하여 워크플로우 오케스트레이션, AgentOS 런타임 및 역할 기반 위임을 갖춘 프로덕션 준비 멀티 에이전트 시스템을 구축할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 부여합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear sistemas multiagentes listos para producción con orquestación de flujos de trabajo, tiempo de ejecución de AgentOS y delegación basada en roles utilizando el marco y las herramientas integrales de Agno.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des systèmes multi-agents prêts pour la production avec une orchestration de workflow, un runtime AgentOS et une délégation basée sur les rôles en utilisant le cadre et les outils complets d''Agno.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, produktionsreife Multi-Agenten-Systeme mit Workflow-Orchestrierung, AgentOS-Laufzeit und rollenbasierter Delegation zu erstellen, indem sie das umfassende Framework und die Tools von Agno verwenden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir sistemas de multi-agentes prontos para produção com orquestração de fluxo de trabalho, tempo de execução do AgentOS e delegação baseada em papéis usando a estrutura e as ferramentas abrangentes da Agno.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать системы многоагентных систем, готовых к производству, с помощью оркестровки рабочего процесса, времени выполнения AgentOS и ролевой делегации с использованием комплексной структуры и инструментов Agno.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء بناء أنظمة متعددة الوكلاء جاهزة للإنتاج مع تنسيق سير العمل، وقت تشغيل AgentOS، وتفعيل على أساس الدور باستخدام الإطار والأدوات الشاملة الخاصة بـ Agno."},"useCases":{"en":["Building AI agents with tools, memory, and structured outputs","Creating multi-agent teams with conditional branching, loops, and async execution","Implementing workflows with MCP integration and AgentOS runtime"],"zh":["使用工具、内存和结构化输出构建AI代理","使用条件分支、循环和异步执行创建多代理团队","实现具有MCP集成和AgentOS运行时的工作流"],"ja":["ツール、メモリ、構造化された出力を使用してAIエージェントを構築する","条件分岐、ループ、非同期実行を使用してマルチエージェントチームを作成する","MCP統合とAgentOSランタイムを備えたワークフローを実装する"],"ko":["툴, 메모리 및 구조화된 출력을 사용하여 AI 에이전트를 구축합니다","조건 분기, 루프 및 비동기 실행을 사용하여 멀티 에이전트 팀을 생성합니다","MCP 통합 및 AgentOS 런타임을 갖춘 워크플로우를 구현합니다"],"es":["Creación de agentes de inteligencia artificial con herramientas, memoria y salidas estructuradas","Creación de equipos de múltiples agentes con ramificación condicional, bucles y ejecución asíncrona","Implementación de flujos de trabajo con integración MCP y tiempo de ejecución de AgentOS"],"fr":["Création d''agents d''intelligence artificielle avec des outils, une mémoire et des sorties structurées","Création d''équipes d''agents multiples avec une ramification conditionnelle, des boucles et une exécution asynchrone","Mise en œuvre de flux de travail avec une intégration MCP et un runtime AgentOS"],"de":["Erstellung von KI-Agents mit Tools, Speicher und strukturierten Ausgaben","Erstellung von Teams mit mehreren Agenten mit bedingter Verzweigung, Schleifen und asynchroner Ausführung","Implementierung von Workflows mit MCP-Integration und AgentOS-Laufzeit"],"pt":["Construir agentes de IA com ferramentas, memória e saídas estruturadas","Criar equipes de agentes múltiplos com ramificação condicional, loops e execução assíncrona","Implementar fluxos de trabalho com integração MCP e tempo de execução do AgentOS"],"ru":["Построение агентов ИИ с помощью инструментов, памяти и структурированных выходных данных","Создание команд многоагентных систем с условным ветвлением, циклами и асинхронным выполнением","Реализация рабочих процессов с интеграцией MCP и временем выполнения AgentOS"],"ar":["بناء وكلاء ذكاء اصطناعي مع أدوات، ذاكرة ومخرجات منظمة","إنشاء فرق وكلاء متعددة مع التفرع الشرطي، الحلقات والتنفيذ غير المتزامن","تنفيذ سير العمل مع تكامل MCP ووقت تشغيل AgentOS"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Agno framework integration","Limited to building multi-agent systems","Dependent on AgentOS runtime and MCP compatibility"],"zh":["需要Agno框架集成","仅限于构建多代理系统","依赖于AgentOS运行时和MCP兼容性"],"ja":["Agnoフレームワークの統合が必要","マルチエージェントシステムの構築に限定される","AgentOSランタイムとMCPの互換性に依存する"],"ko":["Agno 프레임워크 통합이 필요합니다","멀티 에이전트 시스템 구축에만 제한됩니다","AgentOS 런타임 및 MCP 호환성에 종속됩니다"],"es":["Requiere integración con el marco de Agno","Limitado a la creación de sistemas de múltiples agentes","Dependiente de la compatibilidad de AgentOS y MCP"],"fr":["Nécessite une intégration avec le cadre d''Agno","Limité à la création de systèmes multi-agents","Dépendant de la compatibilité d''AgentOS et de MCP"],"de":["Benötigt Integration mit dem Agno-Framework","Begrenzt auf die Erstellung von Multi-Agenten-Systemen","Abhängig von der Kompatibilität von AgentOS und MCP"],"pt":["Exige integração com a estrutura da Agno","Limitado à construção de sistemas de multi-agentes","Dependente do tempo de execução do AgentOS e da compatibilidade com MCP"],"ru":["Требует интеграции с фреймворком Agno","Ограничен построением многоагентных систем","Зависит от времени выполнения AgentOS и совместимости с MCP"],"ar":["يتطلب تكاملًا مع إطار Agno","محدود ببناء أنظمة متعددة الوكلاء","يعتمد على وقت تشغيل AgentOS ومتطلبات التوافق مع MCP"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"30dffd9b81998d70c9659f772dab968f0fe94e3bd95c44f72a04d60451322fed","qualityScore":60}');
