coûts","efficacité des outils"],"de":["Multi-Agenten-Optimierung","Koordination von Agenten","Analyse von Workflows","Orchestrierung von Agenten","Leistungsverbesserung","Software-Agenten","AI-Tools","Kostenoptimierung","Werkzeug-Effizienz"],"pt":["otimização de múltiplos agentes","orquestração de agentes","melhoria da coordenação","otimização de throughput","otimização de latência","profiling de workflows","desenvolvimento de estratégias de orquestração"],"ru":["оптимизация многоагентной оркестрации","оркестрация агентов","улучшение координации","оптимизация пропускной способности","оптимизация задержки","профилирование рабочих процессов","разработка стратегий оркестрации"],"ar":["تحسين إدارة العوامل المتعددة","إدارة العوامل","تحسين التنسيق","تحسين الإنتاجية","تحسين الكفاءة","تحليل سلاسل العمل","تصميم استراتيجيات لإدارة سلاسل العمل"]}},"owner":"ketzal88","repo":"ai-analyzer","repoPath":"ketzal88/ai-analyzer","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-07T20:43:05Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"agent-orchestration-multi-agent-optimize","description":"Optimize multi-agent systems with coordinated profiling, workload distribution, and cost-aware orchestration. Use when improving agent performance, throughput, or reliability.","bodyPreview":"# Multi-Agent Optimization Toolkit\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Improving multi-agent coordination, throughput, or latency\n- Profiling agent workflows to identify bottlenecks\n- Designing orchestration strategies for complex workflows\n- Optimizing cost, context usage, or tool efficiency\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- You only need to tune a single agent prompt\n- There are no measurable metrics or evaluation data\n- The task is unrelated to multi-agent orchestration\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. Establish","body":"# Multi-Agent Optimization Toolkit\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Improving multi-agent coordination, throughput, or latency\n- Profiling agent workflows to identify bottlenecks\n- Designing orchestration strategies for complex workflows\n- Optimizing cost, context usage, or tool efficiency\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- You only need to tune a single agent prompt\n- There are no measurable metrics or evaluation data\n- The task is unrelated to multi-agent orchestration\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. Establish baseline metrics and target performance goals.\n2. Profile agent workloads and identify coordination bottlenecks.\n3. Apply orchestration changes and cost controls incrementally.\n4. Validate improvements with repeatable tests and rollbacks.\n\n## Safety\n\n- Avoid deploying orchestration changes without regression testing.\n- Roll out changes gradually to prevent system-wide regressions.\n\n## Role: AI-Powered Multi-Agent Performance Engineering Specialist\n\n### Context\n\nThe Multi-Agent Optimization Tool is an advanced AI-driven framework designed to holistically improve system performance through intelligent, coordinated agent-based optimization. Leveraging cutting-edge AI orchestration techniques, this tool provides a comprehensive approach to performance engineering across multiple domains.\n\n### Core Capabilities\n\n- Intelligent multi-agent coordination\n- Performance profiling and bottleneck identification\n- Adaptive optimization strategies\n- Cross-domain performance optimization\n- Cost and efficiency tracking\n\n## Arguments Handling\n\nThe tool processes optimization arguments with flexible input parameters:\n\n- `$TARGET`: Primary system/application to optimize\n- `$PERFORMANCE_GOALS`: Specific performance metrics and objectives\n- `$OPTIMIZATION_SCOPE`: Depth of optimization (quick-win, comprehensive)\n- `$BUDGET_CONSTRAINTS`: Cost and resource limitations\n- `$QUALITY_METRICS`: Performance quality thresholds\n\n## 1. Multi-Agent Performance Profiling\n\n### Profiling Strategy\n\n- Distributed performance monitoring across system layers\n- Real-time metrics collection and analysis\n- Continuous performance signature tracking\n\n#### Profiling Agents\n\n1. **Database Performance Agent**\n   - Query execution time analysis\n   - Index utilization tracking\n   - Resource consumption monitoring\n\n2. **Application Performance Agent**\n   - CPU and memory profiling\n   - Algorithmic complexity assessment\n   - Concurrency and async operation analysis\n\n3. **Frontend Performance Agent**\n   - Rendering performance metrics\n   - Network request optimization\n   - Core Web Vitals monitoring\n\n### Profiling Code Example\n\n```python\ndef multi_agent_profiler(target_system):\n    agents = [\n        DatabasePerformanceAgent(target_system),\n        ApplicationPerformanceAgent(target_system),\n        FrontendPerformanceAgent(target_system)\n    ]\n\n    performance_profile = {}\n    for agent in agents:\n        performance_profile[agent.__class__.__name__] = agent.profile()\n\n    return aggregate_performance_metrics(performance_profile)\n```\n\n## 2. Context Window Optimization\n\n### Optimization Techniques\n\n- Intelligent context compression\n- Semantic relevance filtering\n- Dynamic context window resizing\n- Token budget management\n\n### Context Compression Algorithm\n\n```python\ndef compress_context(context, max_tokens=4000):\n    # Semantic compression using embedding-based truncation\n    compressed_context = semantic_truncate(\n        context,\n        max_tokens=max_tokens,\n        importance_threshold=0.7\n    )\n    return compressed_context\n```\n\n## 3. Agent Coordination Efficiency\n\n### Coordination Principles\n\n- Parallel execution design\n- Minimal inter-agent communication overhead\n- Dynamic workload distribution\n- Fault-tolerant agent interactions\n\n### Orchestration Framework\n\n```python\nclass MultiAgentOrchestrator:\n    def __init__(self, agents):\n        self.agents = agents\n        self.execution_queue = PriorityQueue()\n        self.performance_tracker = PerformanceTracker()\n\n    def optimize(self, target_system):\n        # Parallel agent execution with coordinated optimization\n        with concurrent.futures.ThreadPoolExecutor() as executor:\n            futures = {\n                executor.submit(agent.optimize, target_system): agent\n                for agent in self.agents\n            }\n\n            for future in concurrent.futures.as_completed(futures):\n                agent = futures[future]\n                result = future.result()\n                self.performance_tracker.log(agent, result)\n```\n\n## 4. Parallel Execution Optimization\n\n### Key Strategies\n\n- Asynchronous agent processing\n- Workload partitioning\n- Dynamic resource allocation\n- Minimal blocking operations\n\n## 5. Cost Optimization Strategies\n\n### LLM Cost Management\n\n- Token usage tracking\n- Adaptive model selection\n- Caching and result reuse\n- Efficient prompt engineering\n\n### Cost Tracking Example\n\n```python\nclass CostOptimizer:\n    def __init__(self):\n        self.token_budget = 100000  # Monthly budget\n        self.token_usage = 0\n        self.model_costs = {\n            ''gpt-5'': 0.03,\n            ''claude-4-sonnet'': 0.015,\n            ''claude-4-haiku'': 0.0025\n        }\n\n    def select_optimal_model(self, complexity):\n        # Dynamic model selection based on task complexity and budget\n        pass\n```\n\n## 6. Latency Reduction Techniques\n\n### Performance Acceleration\n\n- Predictive caching\n- Pre-warming agent contexts\n- Intelligent result memoization\n- Reduced round-trip communication\n\n## 7. Quality vs Speed Tradeoffs\n\n### Optimization Spectrum\n\n- Performance thresholds\n- Acceptable degradation margins\n- Quality-aware optimization\n- Intelligent compromise selection\n\n## 8. Monitoring and Continuous Improvement\n\n### Observability Framework\n\n- Real-time performance dashboards\n- Automated optimization feedback loops\n- Machine learning-driven improvement\n- Adaptive optimization strategies\n\n## Reference Workflows\n\n### Workflow 1: E-Commerce Platform Optimization\n\n1. Initial performance profiling\n2. Agent-based optimization\n3. Cost and performance tracking\n4. Continuous improvement cycle\n\n### Workflow 2: Enterprise API Performance Enhancement\n\n1. Comprehensive system analysis\n2. Multi-layered agent optimization\n3. Iterative performance refinement\n4. Cost-efficient scaling strategy\n\n## Key Considerations\n\n- Always measure before and after optimization\n- Maintain system stability during optimization\n- Balance performance gains with resource consumption\n- Implement gradual, reversible changes\n\nTarget Optimization: $ARGUMENTS\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:14:29.642Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Advanced AI Agents like AutoGPT and LangChain requiring enhanced multi-agent coordination and workflow optimization.","zh":"适用于像 AutoGPT 和 LangChain 这样的高级 AI Agent，需要增强的多代理协调和工作流优化。","ja":"AutoGPT や LangChain などの高度な AI エージェントに適しており、強化されたマルチエージェントの調整とワークフロー最適化が必要です。","ko":"AutoGPT 및 LangChain과 같은 고급 AI 에이전트에 적합하며, 다중 에이전트 조정 및 워크플로우 최적화가 필요합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de IA Avanzados como AutoGPT y LangChain que requieren una coordinación multiagente mejorada y optimización de flujos de trabajo.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA avancés comme AutoGPT et LangChain nécessitant une coordination multi-agent améliorée et une optimisation des flux de travail.","de":"Ideal für erweiterte KI-Agents wie AutoGPT und LangChain, die eine verbesserte Multiagentenkoordination und Workflows-Optimierung benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA Avançados, como AutoGPT e LangChain, que exigem coordenação multi-agente aprimorada e otimização de fluxo de trabalho.","ru":"Идеально подходит для продвинутых агентов ИИ, таких как AutoGPT и LangChain, требующих улучшенной координации нескольких агентов и оптимизации рабочего процесса.","ar":"مثالية للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي المتقدم مثل AutoGPT و LangChain الذين يتطلبون تنسيق متعدد الوكلاء وتحسين تدفق العمل المحسن."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to optimize complex workflows, identify bottlenecks, and improve throughput and latency using multi-agent orchestration strategies and toolkit, leveraging metrics and evaluation data for informed decision-making.","zh":"使得代理能够优化复杂的工作流，找出瓶颈，使用多代理编排策略和工具包提高吞吐量和延迟，并利用指标和评估数据进行明智的决策。","ja":"エージェントが複雑なワークフローを最適化し、ボトルネックを特定し、マルチエージェントのオーケストレーション戦略とツールキットを使用してスループットと待ち時間を改善し、指標と評価データを使用して情報に基づいた決定を下すことができるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 복잡한 워크플로우를 최적화하고, 병목 현상을 식별하며, 다중 에이전트 오케스트레이션 전략 및 툴킷을 사용하여 처리량 및 대기 시간을 개선하며, 메트릭 및 평가 데이터를 사용하여 정보에 기반한 의사 결정을 내릴 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a optimizar flujos de trabajo complejos, identificar cuellos de botella y mejorar el rendimiento y la latencia utilizando estrategias de orquestación multiagente y herramientas, aprovechando métricas y datos de evaluación para la toma de decisiones informadas.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''optimiser des flux de travail complexes, d''identifier les goulots d''étranglement et d''améliorer le débit et la latence en utilisant des stratégies d''orchestration multi-agent et des outils, en exploitant les métriques et les données d''évaluation pour une prise de décision éclairée.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, komplexe Workflows zu optimieren, Engpässe zu identifizieren und Durchsatz und Latenz mithilfe von Multiagenten-Orchestrierungsstrategien und Toolkit zu verbessern, wobei Metriken und Bewertungsdaten für eine fundierte Entscheidungsfindung genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a otimizar fluxos de trabalho complexos, identificar gargalos e melhorar a produtividade e a latência usando estratégias de orquestração de vários agentes e kit de ferramentas, aproveitando métricas e dados de avaliação para tomada de decisões informadas.","ru":"Позволяет агентам оптимизировать сложные рабочие процессы, выявлять узкие места и提高 производительность и задержку с помощью стратегий оркестровки нескольких агентов и инструментария, используя метрики и данные оценки для принятия обоснованных решений.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تحسين تدفقات العمل المعقدة وتحديد العوائق وتحسين الإنتاجية والزمن باستخدام استراتيجيات توجيه متعددة الوكلاء وأدوات الطرف الثالث، واستخدام المقاييس وبيانات التقييم لاتخاذ قرارات مستنيرة."},"useCases":{"en":["Optimizing multi-agent workflows for improved coordination and efficiency","Profiling agent workflows to identify and address bottlenecks","Designing and implementing effective orchestration strategies for complex tasks"],"zh":["优化多代理工作流以提高协调性和效率","分析代理工作流以找出和解决瓶颈","为复杂任务设计和实施有效的编排策略"],"ja":["調整性と効率性を高めるためにマルチエージェントのワークフローを最適化する","ボトルネックを特定して解決するためにエージェントのワークフローをプロファイルする","複雑なタスクのための効果的なオーケストレーション戦略を設計して実装する"],"ko":["조정성 및 효율성을 높이기 위해 다중 에이전트 워크플로우를 최적화하는 것","병목 현상을 식별하고 해결하기 위해 에이전트 워크플로우를 프로파일링하는 것","복잡한 작업을 위한 효과적인 오케스트레이션 전략을 설계 및 구현하는 것"],"es":["Optimizar flujos de trabajo multiagente para mejorar la coordinación y la eficiencia","Perfilar flujos de trabajo de agentes para identificar y abordar cuellos de botella","Diseñar e implementar estrategias de orquestación efectivas para tareas complejas"],"fr":["Optimiser les flux de travail multi-agent pour améliorer la coordination et l''efficacité","Profiler les flux de travail des agents pour identifier et résoudre les goulots d''étranglement","Concevoir et mettre en œuvre des stratégies d''orchestration efficaces pour des tâches complexes"],"de":["Multiagenten-Workflows optimieren, um Koordination und Effizienz zu verbessern","Agenten-Workflows profilieren, um Engpässe zu identifizieren und anzugehen","Effektive Orchestrierungsstrategien für komplexe Aufgaben entwerfen und umsetzen"],"pt":["Otimização de fluxos de trabalho de vários agentes para melhoria da coordenação e eficiência","Perfil dos fluxos de trabalho dos agentes para identificar e resolver gargalos","Desenvolvimento e implementação de estratégias de orquestração eficazes para tarefas complexas"],"ru":["Оптимизация рабочих процессов нескольких агентов для улучшения координации и эффективности","Профилирование рабочих процессов агентов для выявления и устранения узких мест","Разработка и реализация эффективных стратегий оркестровки для сложных задач"],"ar":["تحسين تدفقات العمل المتعددة الوكلاء لتحسين التنسيق والكفاءة","تحليل مسارات عمل الوكلاء لتحديد العوائق ومعالجتها","تصميم وتنفيذ استراتيجيات توجيه فعالة للمهام المعقدة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires measurable metrics and evaluation data","Not suitable for single-agent prompt tuning","Task must be related to multi-agent orchestration"],"zh":["需要可衡量的指标和评估数据","不适合单代理提示调优","任务必须与多代理编排相关"],"ja":["計測可能な指標と評価データが必要","シングルエージェントのプロンプト調整には適さない","タスクはマルチエージェントのオーケストレーションに関連している必要がある"],"ko":["측정 가능한 메트릭 및 평가 데이터가 필요합니다","단일 에이전트 프롬프트 튜닝에는 적합하지 않습니다","작업은 다중 에이전트 오케스트레이션과 관련이 있어야 합니다"],"es":["Requiere métricas medibles y datos de evaluación","No es adecuado para la afinación de la llamada a un solo agente","La tarea debe estar relacionada con la orquestación multiagente"],"fr":["Nécessite des métriques mesurables et des données d''évaluation","N''est pas adapté pour l''affinage de la commande à un seul agent","La tâche doit être liée à l''orchestration multi-agent"],"de":["Benötigt messbare Metriken und Bewertungsdaten","Nicht geeignet für die Feinabstimmung von Einzelagenten","Die Aufgabe muss mit der Multiagenten-Orchestrierung zusammenhängen"],"pt":["Exige métricas e dados de avaliação mensuráveis","Não é adequado para ajuste de prompt de agente único","A tarefa deve estar relacionada à orquestração de vários agentes"],"ru":["Требует измеримых метрик и данных оценки","Не подходит для настройки подсказки одного агента","Задача должна быть связана с оркестровкой нескольких агентов"],"ar":["يتطلب مقاييس وبيانات تقييم قابلة للقياس","لا يناسب ضبط تلميح وكيل واحد","يجب أن تكون المهمة متعلقة بتوجيه متعددة الوكلاء"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"07e8ae8527830021cbe7c8892dbcd4dfa038f9fb755122417bbf85a0d3744c6c","qualityScore":60}');
