INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('frizynn/gralph/prd', 'prd', 'frizynn', 'gralph', 'community', 'prd frizynn gralph community prd is a high-performance implementation that orchestrates multi-agent execution for AI agents like Amp, Cursor, and Codex. It generates detailed Product Requirements Documents based on user input and clarifying questions. PRD 技术实现了高性能的自动化循环，利用 Git worktree 隔离和多代理执行 PRD は AIエージェントを使用した自動化ループの高性能実装です PRD는 고성능 자동화 루프 구현을 위한 기술로, Git worktree 분리 및 다중 에이전트 실행을 지원 PRD es una implementación de alto rendimiento que orquesta la ejecución de agentes múltiples, utilizando aislamiento de Git worktree para escalar el desarrollo impulsado por PRD PRD est une mise en œuvre de haute performance qui orchestre l''exécution de plusieurs agents, en utilisant l''isolement de Git worktree pour faire évoluer le développement piloté par PRD PRD ist eine Hochleistungs-Implementierung, die die Ausführung von Multi-Agenten orchestriert, indem sie die Isolation von Git worktree zur Skalierung der PRD-getriebenen Entwicklung nutzt O PRD é uma implementação de alto desempenho do loop autônomo Ralph, que orquestra a execução de multi-agentes em Claude Code e Cursor. PRD — это высокопроизводительная реализация автономного цикла Ralph, которая оркестрирует выполнение многоагентных задач в Claude Code и Cursor. PRD هو تنفيذ ذو أداء عالي للدوائر المستقلة رالف، والذي يتولى تنفيذ مهام متعددة الوكلاء في كلود كود وكيرسر. how to use prd prd alternative prd setup guide what is prd prd vs amp prd install prd generator prd for ai agents automated prd generation PRD 技术 自动化循环 Git worktree 隔离 多代理执行 AI 代理 产品需求文档 Claude Code Cursor Builds repository context to avoid ambiguity or conflicts Asks 3-5 essential clarifying questions with lettered options Generates structured PRDs based on user answers Saves PRDs to tasks/prd-[feature-name].md files Utilizes Git worktree isolation for scalable PRD-driven development prd is a skill that automates the creation of Product Requirements Documents, utilizing Git worktree isolation for scalable PRD-driven development');
