:"ros2-launch-system"},"description":{"zh":"ROS2启动系统是一个用于物理AI和人形机器人教育的AI本地学习平台，提供ROS2启动系统的技术摘要","ja":"ROS2 Launch Systemは、物理AIとヒューマノイドロボティクスの教育用AIネイティブ学習プラットフォームです","ko":"ROS2 런치 시스템은 물리적 AI 및 휴머노이드 로봇 교육을 위한 AI 네이티브 학습 플랫폼입니다","es":"La plataforma de aprendizaje nativa de IA para la educación en robótica humanoide y física","fr":"La plateforme d''apprentissage native de l''IA pour l''éducation en robotique humanoïde et physique","de":"Die KI-native Lernplattform für die Bildung in humanoider und physischer Robotik","pt":"O ros2-launch-system é uma plataforma de aprendizado de IA para educação em robótica física e humanoides, permitindo o desenvolvimento de soluções inovadoras","ru":"ros2-launch-system - это ИИ-родная платформа обучения для физической робототехники и гуманоидного образования, позволяющая разрабатывать инновационные решения","ar":"ros2-launch-system هي منصة تعلم الذكاء الاصطناعي الأصلي للتعليم الروبوتي الفيزيائي والإنساني، تمكن من تطوير حلول مبتكرة","en":"AI-Native Learning Platform for Physical AI & Humanoid Robotics Education"},"definition":{"en":"AI-Native Learning Platform for Physical AI & Humanoid Robotics Education"},"features":{"zh":["支持ROS2启动系统","物理AI和人形机器人教育","AI本地学习平台","提供技术摘要","支持多种机器人平台"],"ja":["ROS2 Launch Systemをサポート","物理AIとヒューマノイドロボティクスの教育","AIネイティブ学習プラットフォーム","技術的なサマリーを提供","複数のロボットプラットフォームをサポート"],"ko":["ROS2 런치 시스템 지원","물리적 AI 및 휴머노이드 로봇 교육","AI 네이티브 학습 플랫폼","기술적인 요약 제공","다중 로봇 플랫폼 지원"],"es":["Soporte para ROS2","Educación en robótica humanoide","Aprendizaje de IA nativo","Sistema de lanzamiento integrado","Compatibilidad con herramientas de desarrollo de IA"],"fr":["Prise en charge de ROS2","Éducation en robotique humanoïde","Apprentissage de l''IA natif","Système de lancement intégré","Compatibilité avec les outils de développement de l''IA"],"de":["Unterstützung für ROS2","Bildung in humanoider Robotik","KI-natives Lernen","Integriertes Startsystem","Kompatibilität mit KI-Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["Plataforma de aprendizado de IA nativa","Educação em robótica física e humanoides","Desenvolvimento de soluções inovadoras","Integração com ferramentas de desenvolvimento de IA","Suporte a projetos de robótica avançados"],"ru":["ИИ-родная платформа обучения","Образование в физической робототехнике и гуманоидном образовании","Разработка инновационных решений","Интеграция с инструментами разработки ИИ","Поддержка продвинутых проектов робототехники"],"ar":["منصة تعلم الذكاء الاصطناعي الأصلي","التعليم الروبوتي الفيزيائي والإنساني","تطوير حلول مبتكرة","التكامل مع أدوات تطوير الذكاء الاصطناعي","دعم مشاريع الروبوتات المتقدمة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["ROS2启动系统","AI智能代理","物理AI","人形机器人教育","AI本地学习平台","ROS2启动系统教程","ROS2启动系统安装","ROS2启动系统设置指南"],"ja":["ROS2 Launch System","AIエージェント","物理AI","ヒューマノイドロボティクス","AIネイティブ学習プラットフォーム","ROS2 Launch Systemの使い方","ROS2 Launch Systemのインストール","ROS2 Launch Systemの設定ガイド"],"ko":["ROS2 런치 시스템","AI 에이전트","물리적 AI","휴머노이드 로봇","AI 네이티브 학습 플랫폼","ROS2 런치 시스템 사용법","ROS2 런치 시스템 설치","ROS2 런치 시스템 설정 가이드"],"es":["cómo usar ROS2","qué es la robótica humanoide","alternativas a ROS2","ROS2 vs otros sistemas de lanzamiento","instalación de ROS2","guía de configuración de ROS2"],"fr":["comment utiliser ROS2","quoi est la robotique humanoïde","alternatives à ROS2","ROS2 vs autres systèmes de lancement","installation de ROS2","guide de configuration de ROS2"],"de":["wie man ROS2 verwendet","was ist humanoide Robotik","Alternativen zu ROS2","ROS2 im Vergleich zu anderen Startsystemen","Installation von ROS2","Einrichtungsanleitung für ROS2"],"pt":["como usar ros2-launch-system","o que é ros2-launch-system","ferramentas de ia para robótica","ros2-launch-system vs outros frameworks","instalar ros2-launch-system","guia de configuração do ros2-launch-system"],"ru":["как использовать ros2-launch-system","что такое ros2-launch-system","инструменты ИИ для робототехники","ros2-launch-system vs другие фреймворки","установка ros2-launch-system","руководство по настройке ros2-launch-system"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام ros2-launch-system","ما هو ros2-launch-system","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للروبوتات","ros2-launch-system مقابل إطارات أخرى","تثبيت ros2-launch-system","دليل إعداد ros2-launch-system"]}},"owner":"SARAMALI15792","repo":"AINativeBook","repoPath":"SARAMALI15792/AINativeBook","stars":1,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-22T22:20:07Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ros2-launch-system","description":"Generate ROS 2 Python launch files and multi-node system configurations for educational content. This skill should be used when creating lessons that teach launch file syntax, writing exercises involving multi-node startup, parameter configuration, or generating worked examples for robot system deployment.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# ROS 2 Launch System Skill\n\n**Purpose**: Generate accurate, educational ROS 2 Python launch files and multi-node configurations following official ROS 2 Humble patterns for the Physical AI textbook.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Creating lessons in Chapter 6 (Building Robot Systems)\n- Writing multi-node deployment exercises\n- Generating worked examples for system startup\n- Teaching parameter configuration and node composition\n- Chapter 7 capstone project integration\n\n## Live Documentation Access\n\n**CRITIC","body":"# ROS 2 Launch System Skill\n\n**Purpose**: Generate accurate, educational ROS 2 Python launch files and multi-node configurations following official ROS 2 Humble patterns for the Physical AI textbook.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Creating lessons in Chapter 6 (Building Robot Systems)\n- Writing multi-node deployment exercises\n- Generating worked examples for system startup\n- Teaching parameter configuration and node composition\n- Chapter 7 capstone project integration\n\n## Live Documentation Access\n\n**CRITICAL**: Before generating any code, fetch current ROS 2 documentation using Context7 MCP:\n\n```\nTool: mcp__context7__resolve-library-id\nlibraryName: \"ros2 launch\"\n\nThen:\nTool: mcp__context7__get-library-docs\ncontext7CompatibleLibraryID: [resolved ID]\ntopic: \"launch file python\"\n```\n\nThis ensures launch patterns match current ROS 2 Humble API.\n\n## Launch File Patterns\n\n### Basic Launch File (Canonical)\n\n```python\n# File: launch/robot_system.launch.py\n\nfrom launch import LaunchDescription\nfrom launch_ros.actions import Node\n\ndef generate_launch_description():\n    return LaunchDescription([\n        Node(\n            package=''my_robot_pkg'',\n            executable=''publisher_node'',\n            name=''sensor_publisher'',\n            output=''screen'',\n        ),\n        Node(\n            package=''my_robot_pkg'',\n            executable=''subscriber_node'',\n            name=''data_processor'',\n            output=''screen'',\n        ),\n    ])\n```\n\n### Launch File with Parameters\n\n```python\nfrom launch import LaunchDescription\nfrom launch_ros.actions import Node\n\ndef generate_launch_description():\n    return LaunchDescription([\n        Node(\n            package=''my_robot_pkg'',\n            executable=''configurable_node'',\n            name=''robot_controller'',\n            output=''screen'',\n            parameters=[{\n                ''robot_name'': ''my_robot'',\n                ''update_rate'': 10.0,\n                ''max_speed'': 1.5,\n                ''enabled_sensors'': [''lidar'', ''camera'', ''imu''],\n            }],\n        ),\n    ])\n```\n\n### Launch File with Parameter File (YAML)\n\n```python\nimport os\nfrom ament_index_python.packages import get_package_share_directory\nfrom launch import LaunchDescription\nfrom launch_ros.actions import Node\n\ndef generate_launch_description():\n    config = os.path.join(\n        get_package_share_directory(''my_robot_pkg''),\n        ''config'',\n        ''robot_params.yaml''\n    )\n\n    return LaunchDescription([\n        Node(\n            package=''my_robot_pkg'',\n            executable=''robot_node'',\n            name=''robot_controller'',\n            output=''screen'',\n            parameters=[config],\n        ),\n    ])\n```\n\n### Parameter File (YAML)\n\n```yaml\n# File: config/robot_params.yaml\nrobot_controller:\n  ros__parameters:\n    robot_name: \"physical_ai_bot\"\n    update_rate: 20.0\n    max_linear_speed: 2.0\n    max_angular_speed: 1.57\n    sensors:\n      lidar:\n        enabled: true\n        topic: \"/scan\"\n      camera:\n        enabled: true\n        topic: \"/image_raw\"\n```\n\n### Launch File with Arguments\n\n```python\nfrom launch import LaunchDescription\nfrom launch.actions import DeclareLaunchArgument\nfrom launch.substitutions import LaunchConfiguration\nfrom launch_ros.actions import Node\n\ndef generate_launch_description():\n    # Declare launch arguments\n    robot_name_arg = DeclareLaunchArgument(\n        ''robot_name'',\n        default_value=''default_robot'',\n        description=''Name of the robot''\n    )\n\n    sim_mode_arg = DeclareLaunchArgument(\n        ''sim_mode'',\n        default_value=''true'',\n        description=''Run in simulation mode''\n    )\n\n    return LaunchDescription([\n        robot_name_arg,\n        sim_mode_arg,\n        Node(\n            package=''my_robot_pkg'',\n            executable=''robot_node'',\n            name=''robot_controller'',\n            output=''screen'',\n            parameters=[{\n                ''robot_name'': LaunchConfiguration(''robot_name''),\n                ''simulation'': LaunchConfiguration(''sim_mode''),\n            }],\n        ),\n    ])\n```\n\n## Package Structure for Launch Files\n\n```\nmy_robot_pkg/\n├── my_robot_pkg/\n│   ├── __init__.py\n│   ├── publisher_node.py\n│   └── subscriber_node.py\n├── launch/\n│   ├── robot_system.launch.py\n│   └── debug_system.launch.py\n├── config/\n│   ├── robot_params.yaml\n│   └── debug_params.yaml\n├── package.xml\n├── setup.py\n└── setup.cfg\n```\n\n### setup.py (Essential Parts for Launch)\n\n```python\nfrom setuptools import setup\nimport os\nfrom glob import glob\n\npackage_name = ''my_robot_pkg''\n\nsetup(\n    name=package_name,\n    version=''0.1.0'',\n    packages=[package_name],\n    data_files=[\n        (''share/ament_index/resource_index/packages'',\n            [''resource/'' + package_name]),\n        (''share/'' + package_name, [''package.xml'']),\n        # Include launch files\n        (os.path.join(''share'', package_name, ''launch''),\n            glob(''launch/*.launch.py'')),\n        # Include config files\n        (os.path.join(''share'', package_name, ''config''),\n            glob(''config/*.yaml'')),\n    ],\n    install_requires=[''setuptools''],\n    entry_points={\n        ''console_scripts'': [\n            ''publisher_node = my_robot_pkg.publisher_node:main'',\n            ''subscriber_node = my_robot_pkg.subscriber_node:main'',\n        ],\n    },\n)\n```\n\n## Debugging Multi-Node Systems\n\n### Using ros2doctor\n\n```bash\n# Check system health\nros2 doctor\n\n# Verbose output\nros2 doctor --report\n```\n\n### Using rqt_graph\n\n```bash\n# Visualize node graph\nros2 run rqt_graph rqt_graph\n```\n\n### Logging Levels\n\n```python\n# In node code\nself.get_logger().debug(''Detailed debug info'')\nself.get_logger().info(''Normal operation'')\nself.get_logger().warn(''Warning condition'')\nself.get_logger().error(''Error occurred'')\nself.get_logger().fatal(''Fatal error'')\n```\n\n```bash\n# Set log level at runtime\nros2 run my_pkg my_node --ros-args --log-level debug\n```\n\n## Educational Requirements\n\n### Layer 1 (Manual Foundation)\n- Explain launch file structure and purpose\n- Walk through LaunchDescription components\n- Demonstrate parameter passing patterns\n\n### Layer 2 (AI Collaboration)\n- Generate launch files from system requirements\n- Debug multi-node communication issues with AI\n- Optimize node configuration (Three Roles INVISIBLE)\n\n### Layer 3 (Intelligence Design)\n- System architecture patterns\n- Configuration management strategies\n- Reusable launch file components\n\n### Layer 4 (Spec-Driven)\n- Design system from specification\n- Multi-node integration testing\n- Capstone project orchestration\n\n## Hardware Tier Compatibility\n\nAll launch files MUST work on:\n- **Tier 1**: Cloud ROS 2 (TheConstruct) with turtlesim\n- **Tier 2+**: Local ROS 2 Humble with physical robots\n\nLaunch commands:\n```bash\n# Build and source\ncd ~/ros2_ws\ncolcon build --packages-select my_robot_pkg\nsource install/setup.bash\n\n# Launch\nros2 launch my_robot_pkg robot_system.launch.py\n\n# Launch with arguments\nros2 launch my_robot_pkg robot_system.launch.py robot_name:=my_bot sim_mode:=false\n```\n\n## Common Mistakes to Prevent\n\n1. **Missing data_files in setup.py**: Launch files won''t be installed\n2. **Wrong path in get_package_share_directory**: Package name must match\n3. **Forgetting to rebuild**: Changes require `colcon build`\n4. **Parameter type mismatches**: YAML types must match node expectations\n\n## Integration with Other Skills\n\n- **ros2-publisher-subscriber**: Nodes to launch\n- **ros2-service-pattern**: Service nodes in system\n- **ros2-custom-interfaces**: Interface packages as dependencies\n- **lesson-generator**: For full lesson structure\n\n## Authoritative Source\n\nAll patterns verified against:\n- https://docs.ros.org/en/humble/Tutorials/Intermediate/Launch/Creating-Launch-Files.html\n- https://docs.ros.org/en/humble/Tutorials/Beginner-Client-Libraries/Using-Parameters-In-A-Class-Python.html\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-26T08:43:44.374Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Robotics Agents needing advanced ROS 2 launch file generation and multi-node configuration capabilities.","zh":"适合需要高级ROS 2启动文件生成和多节点配置能力的机器人代理。","ja":"ロボティクスエージェントが高度なROS 2起動ファイル生成とマルチノード構成能力を必要とする場合に適しています。","ko":"ROS 2 시작 파일 생성 및 다중 노드 구성 기능을 사용하는 로봇 공학 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de robótica que necesitan generación avanzada de archivos de lanzamiento de ROS 2 y capacidades de configuración de multi-nodo.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de robotique nécessitant une génération de fichiers de lancement ROS 2 avancée et des capacités de configuration de multi-nœuds.","de":"Perfekt für Robotics-Agents, die eine erweiterte ROS 2-Startdatei-Generierung und Multi-Knoten-Konfigurationsfähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de robótica que necessitam de geração avançada de arquivos de lançamento do ROS 2 e capacidades de configuração de vários nodos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов робототехники, которым необходима продвинутая генерация файлов запуска ROS 2 и возможности конфигурации нескольких узлов.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الروبوتات الذي يحتاج إلى توليد متقدم لملفات إطلاق ROS 2 وقدرات cấuture متعددة العقد."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate accurate, educational ROS 2 Python launch files and multi-node configurations following official ROS 2 Humble patterns, utilizing Python and ROS 2 libraries for Physical AI and Humanoid Robotics Education.","zh":"赋予代理生成准确、教育性的ROS 2 Python启动文件和多节点配置，遵循官方ROS 2 Humble模式，利用Python和ROS 2库用于物理AI和人形机器人教育。","ja":"エージェントに、公式のROS 2 Humbleパターンに従った正確で教育的なROS 2 Python起動ファイルとマルチノード構成を生成する権限を与え、Physical AIとヒューマノイドロボット教育のためのPythonとROS 2ライブラリを利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 공식 ROS 2 Humble 패턴을 따르는 정확하고 교육적인 ROS 2 Python 시작 파일 및 다중 노드 구성 생성을 가능하게 하며, 피지컬 AI 및 휴머노이드 로봇 교육을 위한 Python 및 ROS 2 라이브러리를 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes para generar archivos de lanzamiento de ROS 2 de Python precisos y educativos, y configuraciones de multi-nodo siguiendo los patrones oficiales de ROS 2 Humble, utilizando Python y bibliotecas de ROS 2 para la educación en Inteligencia Artificial Física y Robótica Humanoid.","fr":"Habilite les agents à générer des fichiers de lancement ROS 2 Python précis et éducatifs, et des configurations de multi-nœuds suivant les modèles officiels de ROS 2 Humble, en utilisant Python et les bibliothèques ROS 2 pour l''éducation en Intelligence Artificielle Physique et Robotique Humanoïde.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, genaue, lehrreiche ROS 2-Python-Startdateien und Multi-Knoten-Konfigurationen zu generieren, die den offiziellen ROS 2 Humble-Mustern folgen, unter Verwendung von Python und ROS 2-Bibliotheken für die Ausbildung in physischer künstlicher Intelligenz und humanoider Robotik.","pt":"Concede poder aos agentes para gerar arquivos de lançamento do ROS 2 Python precisos e educacionais e configurações de vários nodos seguindo os padrões oficiais do ROS 2 Humble, utilizando Python e bibliotecas do ROS 2 para Educação de Robótica Física e Robótica Humanóide.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать точные и образовательные файлы запуска ROS 2 Python и конфигурации нескольких узлов, следуя официальным шаблонам ROS 2 Humble, используя Python и библиотеки ROS 2 для образования в области физической и гуманоидной робототехники.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على توليد ملفات إطلاق ROS 2 Python دقيقة وتربوية وتكوينات عقد متعددة متابعة للأنماط الرسمية لROS 2 Humble، باستخدام Python ومكتبات ROS 2 للتعليم في مجال الروبوتات الفيزيائية والروبوتات الإنسانية."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating multi-node deployment exercises","Creating educational ROS 2 launch files","Teaching parameter configuration and node composition for Chapter 7 capstone projects"],"zh":["生成多节点部署练习","创建教育ROS 2启动文件","教授第7章结课项目的参数配置和节点组成"],"ja":["マルチノード展開の練習を生成する","教育用ROS 2起動ファイルを作成する","第7章のキャップストーンプロジェクトのパラメータ構成とノード構成を教える"],"ko":["다중 노드 배포 연습 생성","교육용 ROS 2 시작 파일 생성","7장 캡스톤 프로젝트의 매개변수 구성 및 노드 구성 教育"],"es":["Generación de ejercicios de implementación de multi-nodo","Creación de archivos de lanzamiento de ROS 2 educativos","Enseñanza de la configuración de parámetros y composición de nodos para proyectos de piedra angular del Capítulo 7"],"fr":["Génération d''exercices de déploiement de multi-nœuds","Création de fichiers de lancement ROS 2 éducatifs","Enseignement de la configuration des paramètres et de la composition des nœuds pour les projets de pierre angulaire du Chapitre 7"],"de":["Generierung von Multi-Knoten-Bereitstellungsübungen","Erstellung von lehrreichen ROS 2-Startdateien","Lehre der Parameterkonfiguration und Knotenkomposition für die Eckpfeilerprojekte des Kapitels 7"],"pt":["Geração de exercícios de implantação de vários nodos","Criação de arquivos de lançamento do ROS 2 educacionais","Ensino de configuração de parâmetros e composição de nodos para projetos de capstone do Capítulo 7"],"ru":["Генерация упражнений по развертыванию нескольких узлов","Создание образовательных файлов запуска ROS 2","Обучение конфигурации параметров и составлению узлов для проектов капстоуна главы 7"],"ar":["توليد تمارين لنشر عقد متعددة","إنشاء ملفات إطلاق ROS 2 تعليمية","تعليم تكوين المعاملات وتركيب العقد لمشاريع الحجر الزاوية للفصل 7"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires ROS 2 Humble installation","Limited to Python-based launch files","Specific to Physical AI and Humanoid Robotics Education curriculum"],"zh":["需要ROS 2 Humble安装","仅限Python基于启动文件","特定于物理AI和人形机器人教育课程"],"ja":["ROS 2 Humbleのインストールが必要","Pythonベースの起動ファイルのみ","Physical AIとヒューマノイドロボット教育のカリキュラムに特化"],"ko":["ROS 2 Humble 설치 필요","Python 기반 시작 파일만 해당","피지컬 AI 및 휴머노이드 로봇 교육 커리큘럼 전용"],"es":["Requiere instalación de ROS 2 Humble","Limitado a archivos de lanzamiento basados en Python","Específico para el plan de estudios de educación en Inteligencia Artificial Física y Robótica Humanoid"],"fr":["Nécessite une installation de ROS 2 Humble","Limité aux fichiers de lancement basés sur Python","Spécifique au programme d''éducation en Intelligence Artificielle Physique et Robotique Humanoïde"],"de":["Benötigt eine ROS 2 Humble-Installation","Begrenzt auf Python-basierte Startdateien","Spezifisch für den Lehrplan der Ausbildung in physischer künstlicher Intelligenz und humanoider Robotik"],"pt":["Requer instalação do ROS 2 Humble","Limitado a arquivos de lançamento baseados em Python","Específico para o currículo de Educação de Robótica Física e Robótica Humanóide"],"ru":["Требует установки ROS 2 Humble","Ограничен файлами запуска на основе Python","Специфичен для учебной программы по физической и гуманоидной робототехнике"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت ROS 2 Humble","محدود bằng ملفات إطلاق مبنية على Python","محدد من أجل المناهج الدراسية للتعليم في مجال الروبوتات الفيزيائية والروبوتات الإنسانية"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"1d79309c4e7e0f961c03bdf238a3cbcf0862abbd7056572c16d8fcd2f43438b1","qualityScore":60}');
