,"pt":"Ferramentas de IA: GitHub CLI - Gerenciamento de Certific...","ru":"ИИ Агенты: GitHub CLI - Управление жизненным циклом серти...","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: GitHub CLI - إدارة دورة حياة شهاد...","en":"GitHub CLI"},"description":{"zh":"GitHub CLI AI工具提供安全的X.509证书生命周期管理，支持Cosmian KMS集成，简化证书管理流程","ja":"GitHub CLI AIエージェントは、安全なX.509証明書のライフサイクル管理を提供し、Cosmian KMSをサポートして証明書管理プロセスを簡素化します","ko":"GitHub CLI AI 에이전트는 보안이 강화된 X.509 인증서 수명주기 관리를 제공하며 Cosmian KMS를 지원하여 인증서 관리 프로세스를 간소화합니다","es":"GitHub CLI es una herramienta para la gestión segura del ciclo de vida de certificados X.509 con integración de Cosmian KMS.","fr":"GitHub CLI est un outil pour la gestion sécurisée du cycle de vie des certificats X.509 avec intégration de Cosmian KMS.","de":"GitHub CLI ist ein Tool für das sichere Zertifikatsmanagement von X.509 mit Integration von Cosmian KMS.","pt":"O GitHub CLI é uma ferramenta de gerenciamento de certificados X.509 segura com integração do Cosmian KMS, permitindo o gerenciamento de ciclo de vida de cer...","ru":"GitHub CLI - это инструмент для безопасного управления сертификатами X.509 с интеграцией Cosmian KMS, обеспечивающий управление жизненным циклом сертификатов.","ar":"GitHub CLI هو أداة لإدارة شهادات X.509 آمنة مع دمج Cosmian KMS، مما يسمح بإدارة دورة حياة الشهادات.","en":"Web-based PKI Manager - Secure X.509 certificate lifecycle management with Cosmian KMS integration"},"definition":{"en":"Web-based PKI Manager - Secure X.509 certificate lifecycle management with Cosmian KMS integration"},"features":{"zh":["安全的X.509证书生命周期管理","Cosmian KMS集成","简化证书管理流程","支持Web-based PKI管理","高级安全功能"],"ja":["安全なX.509証明書のライフサイクル管理","Cosmian KMSをサポート","証明書管理プロセスの簡素化","WebベースのPKI管理をサポート","高度なセキュリティ機能"],"ko":["보안이 강화된 X.509 인증서 수명주기 관리","Cosmian KMS 지원","인증서 관리 프로세스 간소화","웹 기반의 PKI 관리 지원","고급 보안 기능"],"es":["Gestión segura de certificados X.509","Integración con Cosmian KMS","Administración del ciclo de vida de certificados","Uso de línea de comandos para operaciones de certificado","Compatibilidad con estándares de certificado X.509"],"fr":["Gestion sécurisée des certificats X.509","Intégration avec Cosmian KMS","Administration du cycle de vie des certificats","Utilisation de la ligne de commande pour les opérations de certificat","Compatibilité avec les normes de certificat X.509"],"de":["Sicheres Zertifikatsmanagement von X.509","Integration mit Cosmian KMS","Verwaltung des Zertifikatslebenszyklus","Verwendung der Kommandozeile für Zertifikatsoperationen","Kompatibilität mit X.509-Zertifikatstandards"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de certificados X.509","Integração com Cosmian KMS","Gerenciamento de ciclo de vida de certificados","Segurança avançada","Fácil de usar"],"ru":["Управление сертификатами X.509","Интеграция с Cosmian KMS","Управление жизненным циклом сертификатов","Продвинутая безопасность","Легко использовать"],"ar":["إدارة شهادات X.509","التكامل مع Cosmian KMS","إدارة دورة حياة الشهادات","أمان متقدم","سهل الاستخدام"]},"keywords":{"zh":["GitHub CLI AI工具","X.509证书生命周期管理","Cosmian KMS","PKI管理器","如何使用GitHub CLI AI工具","GitHub CLI AI工具安装","GitHub CLI AI工具替代品"],"ja":["GitHub CLI AIエージェント","X.509証明書のライフサイクル管理","Cosmian KMS","PKIマネージャー","GitHub CLI AIエージェントの使い方","GitHub CLI AIエージェントのインストール","GitHub CLI AIエージェントの代替"],"ko":["GitHub CLI AI 에이전트","X.509 인증서 수명주기 관리","Cosmian KMS","PKI 매니저","GitHub CLI AI 에이전트 사용법","GitHub CLI AI 에이전트 설치","GitHub CLI AI 에이전트 대안"],"es":["cómo usar GitHub CLI","qué es Cosmian KMS","herramientas de AI para certificados","GitHub CLI vs otros gestores de certificados","instalación de GitHub CLI","guía de configuración de GitHub CLI","gestión de certificados X.509 con GitHub CLI"],"fr":["comment utiliser GitHub CLI","quoi est Cosmian KMS","outils d''IA pour les certificats","GitHub CLI vs autres gestionnaires de certificats","installation de GitHub CLI","guide de configuration de GitHub CLI","gestion des certificats X.509 avec GitHub CLI"],"de":["wie man GitHub CLI verwendet","was ist Cosmian KMS","KI-Tools für Zertifikate","GitHub CLI vs andere Zertifikatsmanager","Installation von GitHub CLI","Konfigurationsanleitung für GitHub CLI","Zertifikatsmanagement von X.509 mit GitHub CLI"],"pt":["como usar github cli","o que é github cli","github cli vs git","github cli alternative","github cli install","github cli setup guide","gerenciamento de certificados","cosmian kms"],"ru":["как использовать github cli","что такое github cli","github cli vs git","github cli alternative","github cli установка","github cli руководство по настройке","управление сертификатами","cosmian kms"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام github cli","ما هو github cli","github cli vs git","github cli alternative","github cli تثبيت","github cli دليل الإعداد","إدارة الشهادات","cosmian kms"]}},"owner":"oriolrius","repo":"pki-manager-web","repoPath":"oriolrius/pki-manager-web","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-05T06:20:06.271Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"GitHub CLI","description":"Expert help with GitHub CLI (gh) for managing pull requests, issues, repositories, workflows, and releases. Use this when working with GitHub operations from the command line, creating new releases, or bumping package versions.","bodyPreview":"# GitHub CLI (gh)\n\nExpert guidance for GitHub CLI operations and workflows.\n\n## Installation & Setup\n\n```bash\n# Login to GitHub\ngh auth login\n\n# Check authentication status\ngh auth status\n\n# Configure git to use gh as credential helper\ngh auth setup-git\n```\n\n## Pull Requests\n\n### Creating PRs\n```bash\n# Create PR interactively\ngh pr create\n\n# Create PR with title and body\ngh pr create --title \"Add feature\" --body \"Description\"\n\n# Create PR to specific branch\ngh pr create --base main --head featur","body":"# GitHub CLI (gh)\n\nExpert guidance for GitHub CLI operations and workflows.\n\n## Installation & Setup\n\n```bash\n# Login to GitHub\ngh auth login\n\n# Check authentication status\ngh auth status\n\n# Configure git to use gh as credential helper\ngh auth setup-git\n```\n\n## Pull Requests\n\n### Creating PRs\n```bash\n# Create PR interactively\ngh pr create\n\n# Create PR with title and body\ngh pr create --title \"Add feature\" --body \"Description\"\n\n# Create PR to specific branch\ngh pr create --base main --head feature-branch\n\n# Create draft PR\ngh pr create --draft\n\n# Create PR from current branch\ngh pr create --fill  # Uses commit messages\n```\n\n### Viewing PRs\n```bash\n# List PRs\ngh pr list\n\n# List my PRs\ngh pr list --author @me\n\n# View PR details\ngh pr view 123\n\n# View PR in browser\ngh pr view 123 --web\n\n# View PR diff\ngh pr diff 123\n\n# Check PR status\ngh pr status\n```\n\n### Managing PRs\n```bash\n# Checkout PR locally\ngh pr checkout 123\n\n# Review PR\ngh pr review 123 --approve\ngh pr review 123 --comment --body \"Looks good!\"\ngh pr review 123 --request-changes --body \"Please fix X\"\n\n# Merge PR\ngh pr merge 123\ngh pr merge 123 --squash\ngh pr merge 123 --rebase\ngh pr merge 123 --merge\n\n# Close PR\ngh pr close 123\n\n# Reopen PR\ngh pr reopen 123\n\n# Ready draft PR\ngh pr ready 123\n```\n\n### PR Checks\n```bash\n# View PR checks\ngh pr checks 123\n\n# Watch PR checks\ngh pr checks 123 --watch\n```\n\n## Issues\n\n### Creating Issues\n```bash\n# Create issue interactively\ngh issue create\n\n# Create issue with title and body\ngh issue create --title \"Bug report\" --body \"Description\"\n\n# Create issue with labels\ngh issue create --title \"Bug\" --label bug,critical\n\n# Assign issue\ngh issue create --title \"Task\" --assignee @me\n```\n\n### Viewing Issues\n```bash\n# List issues\ngh issue list\n\n# List my issues\ngh issue list --assignee @me\n\n# List by label\ngh issue list --label bug\n\n# View issue details\ngh issue view 456\n\n# View in browser\ngh issue view 456 --web\n```\n\n### Managing Issues\n```bash\n# Close issue\ngh issue close 456\n\n# Reopen issue\ngh issue reopen 456\n\n# Edit issue\ngh issue edit 456 --title \"New title\"\ngh issue edit 456 --add-label bug\ngh issue edit 456 --add-assignee @user\n\n# Comment on issue\ngh issue comment 456 --body \"Update\"\n```\n\n## Repository Operations\n\n### Repository Info\n```bash\n# View repository\ngh repo view\n\n# View in browser\ngh repo view --web\n\n# Clone repository\ngh repo clone owner/repo\n\n# Fork repository\ngh repo fork owner/repo\n\n# List repositories\ngh repo list owner\n```\n\n### Repository Management\n```bash\n# Create repository\ngh repo create my-repo --public\ngh repo create my-repo --private\n\n# Delete repository\ngh repo delete owner/repo\n\n# Sync fork\ngh repo sync owner/repo\n\n# Set default repository\ngh repo set-default\n```\n\n## Workflows & Actions\n\n### Viewing Workflows\n```bash\n# List workflows\ngh workflow list\n\n# View workflow runs\ngh run list\n\n# View specific run\ngh run view 789\n\n# Watch run\ngh run watch 789\n\n# View run logs\ngh run view 789 --log\n```\n\n### Managing Workflows\n```bash\n# Trigger workflow\ngh workflow run workflow.yml\n\n# Cancel run\ngh run cancel 789\n\n# Rerun workflow\ngh run rerun 789\n\n# Download artifacts\ngh run download 789\n```\n\n## Releases\n\n### Creating Releases\n```bash\n# Create release\ngh release create v1.0.0\n\n# Create release with notes\ngh release create v1.0.0 --notes \"Release notes\"\n\n# Create release with files\ngh release create v1.0.0 dist/*.tar.gz\n\n# Create draft release\ngh release create v1.0.0 --draft\n\n# Generate release notes automatically\ngh release create v1.0.0 --generate-notes\n```\n\n### Managing Releases\n```bash\n# List releases\ngh release list\n\n# View release\ngh release view v1.0.0\n\n# Download release assets\ngh release download v1.0.0\n\n# Delete release\ngh release delete v1.0.0\n```\n\n## Version Management (pki-manager specific)\n\n**IMPORTANT**: When creating a new release for this project, you MUST bump the version in ALL THREE package.json files:\n- `package.json` (root - authoritative source)\n- `frontend/package.json`\n- `backend/package.json`\n\n### Version Bump Types (Semantic Versioning)\n\n| Type | When to use | Example |\n|------|-------------|---------|\n| **patch** | Bug fixes, minor changes | `1.2.0` → `1.2.1` |\n| **minor** | New features, backwards compatible | `1.2.0` → `1.3.0` |\n| **major** | Breaking changes | `1.2.0` → `2.0.0` |\n\n### Pre-Release Workflow\n\nBefore creating a release, you MUST:\n\n1. **Check current version** in root package.json\n2. **Determine bump type** based on changes since last release\n3. **Update ALL package.json files** with the new version\n4. **Commit version changes** with message: `chore: bump version to vX.Y.Z`\n5. **Create git tag**: `git tag vX.Y.Z`\n6. **Push tag**: `git push origin vX.Y.Z`\n7. **Create GitHub release**: `gh release create vX.Y.Z --generate-notes`\n\n### Complete Release Workflow\n\n```bash\n# 1. Determine current version\ncat package.json | grep ''\"version\"''\n# Output: \"version\": \"1.2.0\"\n\n# 2. Update versions in all package.json files\n# For patch bump (1.2.0 → 1.2.1):\nNEW_VERSION=\"1.2.1\"\n\n# Edit package.json (root)\n# Edit frontend/package.json\n# Edit backend/package.json\n# All three must have the same version!\n\n# 3. Commit version bump\ngit add package.json frontend/package.json backend/package.json\ngit commit -m \"chore: bump version to v${NEW_VERSION}\"\n\n# 4. Create and push tag\ngit tag \"v${NEW_VERSION}\"\ngit push origin main\ngit push origin \"v${NEW_VERSION}\"\n\n# 5. Create GitHub release with auto-generated notes\ngh release create \"v${NEW_VERSION}\" --generate-notes\n\n# Or with custom notes\ngh release create \"v${NEW_VERSION}\" --notes \"## What''s Changed\n- Feature A\n- Bug fix B\n- Improvement C\"\n```\n\n### Version Synchronization Rules\n\n**CRITICAL**: All three package.json files MUST have matching versions:\n\n| File | Path | Must Match Root |\n|------|------|-----------------|\n| Root | `package.json` | ✓ (authoritative) |\n| Frontend | `frontend/package.json` | ✓ |\n| Backend | `backend/package.json` | ✓ |\n\n### Checking Version Consistency\n\n```bash\n# Quick check all versions\necho \"Root: $(cat package.json | grep ''\"version\"'' | head -1)\"\necho \"Frontend: $(cat frontend/package.json | grep ''\"version\"'' | head -1)\"\necho \"Backend: $(cat backend/package.json | grep ''\"version\"'' | head -1)\"\n```\n\n### Release Checklist\n\nBefore releasing, verify:\n- [ ] All tests pass (`pnpm test`)\n- [ ] Build succeeds (`pnpm build`)\n- [ ] All three package.json versions match\n- [ ] Changes are committed to main branch\n- [ ] No uncommitted changes (`git status`)\n- [ ] Previous release tag exists for comparison\n\n## Gists\n\n```bash\n# Create gist\ngh gist create file.txt\n\n# Create gist from stdin\necho \"content\" | gh gist create -\n\n# List gists\ngh gist list\n\n# View gist\ngh gist view <gist-id>\n\n# Edit gist\ngh gist edit <gist-id>\n\n# Delete gist\ngh gist delete <gist-id>\n```\n\n## Advanced Features\n\n### Aliases\n```bash\n# Create alias\ngh alias set pv \"pr view\"\ngh alias set bugs \"issue list --label bug\"\n\n# List aliases\ngh alias list\n\n# Use alias\ngh pv 123\n```\n\n### API Access\n```bash\n# Make API call\ngh api repos/:owner/:repo/issues\n\n# With JSON data\ngh api repos/:owner/:repo/issues -f title=\"Bug\" -f body=\"Description\"\n\n# Paginated results\ngh api --paginate repos/:owner/:repo/issues\n```\n\n### Extensions\n```bash\n# List extensions\ngh extension list\n\n# Install extension\ngh extension install owner/gh-extension\n\n# Upgrade extensions\ngh extension upgrade --all\n```\n\n## Common Workflows\n\n### Code Review Workflow\n```bash\n# List PRs assigned to you\ngh pr list --assignee @me\n\n# Checkout PR for testing\ngh pr checkout 123\n\n# Run tests, review code...\n\n# Approve PR\ngh pr review 123 --approve --body \"LGTM!\"\n\n# Merge PR\ngh pr merge 123 --squash\n```\n\n### Quick PR Creation\n```bash\n# Create feature branch, make changes, commit\ngit checkout -b feature/new-feature\n# ... make changes ...\ngit add .\ngit commit -m \"Add new feature\"\ngit push -u origin feature/new-feature\n\n# Create PR from commits\ngh pr create --fill\n\n# View PR\ngh pr view --web\n```\n\n### Issue Triage\n```bash\n# List open issues\ngh issue list\n\n# Add labels to issues\ngh issue edit 456 --add-label needs-triage\ngh issue edit 456 --add-label bug\n\n# Assign issue\ngh issue edit 456 --add-assignee @developer\n```\n\n## Configuration\n\n```bash\n# Set default editor\ngh config set editor vim\n\n# Set default git protocol\ngh config set git_protocol ssh\n\n# View configuration\ngh config list\n\n# Set browser\ngh config set browser firefox\n```\n\n## Tips\n\n1. **Use `--web` flag**: Open items in browser for detailed view\n2. **Interactive prompts**: Most commands work interactively if you omit parameters\n3. **Filters**: Use `--author`, `--label`, `--state` to filter lists\n4. **JSON output**: Add `--json` flag for scriptable output\n5. **Template repos**: Use `gh repo create --template` for templates\n6. **Auto-merge**: Enable with `gh pr merge --auto`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-05T08:03:52.709Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for DevOps Agents needing streamlined GitHub workflow automation and X.509 certificate management.","zh":"非常适合需要简化GitHub工作流自动化和X.509证书管理的DevOps代理。","ja":"GitHubのワークフロー自動化とX.509証明書管理を効率化する必要があるDevOpsエージェントに最適です。","ko":"GitHub 워크플로 자동화 및 X.509 인증서 관리를简化해야 하는 DevOps 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de DevOps que necesitan una automatización de flujo de trabajo de GitHub simplificada y una gestión de certificados X.509.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents DevOps ayant besoin d''une automatisation de workflow GitHub simplifiée et d''une gestion de certificats X.509.","de":"Perfekt für DevOps-Agents, die eine vereinfachte GitHub-Workflow-Automatisierung und eine X.509-Zertifikatverwaltung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes DevOps que precisam de automação de fluxo de trabalho do GitHub simplificada e gerenciamento de certificado X.509.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов DevOps, которым необходима упрощенная автоматизация рабочего процесса GitHub и управление сертификатами X.509.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء DevOps الذين يحتاجون إلى تautomatization تدفق العمل على GitHub وبصمة إدارة شهادة X.509."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage GitHub repositories securely with Cosmian KMS integration, facilitating tasks like pull request creation and authentication setup using gh auth and git credentials helper.","zh":"赋予代理管理GitHub仓库的安全功能，通过与Cosmian KMS集成，实现诸如创建拉取请求和使用gh auth和git凭据助手设置身份验证等任务。","ja":"エージェントがGitHubリポジトリを安全に管理できるようにし、Cosmian KMSとの統合により、プルリクエストの作成やgh authおよびgitクレデンシャルヘルパーを使用した認証の設定などのタスクを容易にします。","ko":"에이전트가 GitHub 리포지토리를 안전하게 관리할 수 있도록 하며, Cosmian KMS와의 통합을 통해 풀 요청 생성 및 gh auth 및 git 자격증명 도우미를 사용한 인증 설정 등의 작업을 쉽게 수행할 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar repositorios de GitHub de forma segura con la integración de Cosmian KMS, facilitando tareas como la creación de solicitudes de extracción y la configuración de autenticación utilizando gh auth y git credentials helper.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les référentiels GitHub de manière sécurisée avec l''intégration de Cosmian KMS, facilitant des tâches comme la création de demandes d''extraction et la configuration de l''authentification à l''aide de gh auth et de l''aide de credentials git.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, GitHub-Repositorys sicher mit der Integration von Cosmian KMS zu verwalten, wodurch Aufgaben wie die Erstellung von Pull-Anfragen und die Authentifizierungseinrichtung mithilfe von gh auth und git-Zugangsdaten-Helfer erleichtert werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar repositórios do GitHub de forma segura com integração do Cosmian KMS, facilitando tarefas como criação de solicitações de pull e configuração de autenticação usando gh auth e git credentials helper.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять репозиториями GitHub безопасно с помощью интеграции с Cosmian KMS, что облегчает задачи, такие как создание запросов на pulls и настройка аутентификации с помощью gh auth и git credentials helper.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إدارة مستودعات GitHub بشكل آمن مع التكامل مع Cosmian KMS، مما يسهل المهام مثل إنشاء طلبات السحب وتكوين الإعدادات باستخدام gh auth و git credentials helper."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating pull request creation with custom titles and descriptions","Configuring git to use gh as a credential helper for seamless authentication","Debugging authentication status with gh auth status for troubleshooting"],"zh":["使用自定义标题和描述自动创建拉取请求","将git配置为使用gh作为凭据助手以实现无缝身份验证","使用gh auth状态调试身份验证状态以进行故障排除"],"ja":["カスタムタイトルと説明を使用してプルリクエストを作成する自動化","gitをghクレデンシャルヘルパーとして使用するように構成し、シームレスな認証を実現する","gh authステータスを使用して認証ステータスをデバッグし、トラブルシューティングを行う"],"ko":["사용자 지정 제목과 설명을 사용하여 풀 요청을 자동으로 생성하는 것","git를 gh 자격증명 도우미로 사용하도록 구성하여 무결점 인증을 구현하는 것","gh auth 상태를 사용하여 인증 상태를 디버깅하고 문제 해결을 수행하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar la creación de solicitudes de extracción con títulos y descripciones personalizados","Configurar git para utilizar gh como ayudante de credenciales para una autenticación sin problemas","Depurar el estado de autenticación con gh auth status para la solución de problemas"],"fr":["Automatiser la création de demandes d''extraction avec des titres et des descriptions personnalisés","Configurer git pour utiliser gh comme aide de credentials pour une authentification sans interruption","Déboguer le statut d''authentification avec gh auth status pour la résolution de problèmes"],"de":["Automatisieren der Erstellung von Pull-Anfragen mit benutzerdefinierten Titeln und Beschreibungen","Konfigurieren von git zum Verwenden von gh als Zugangsdaten-Helfer für eine reibungslose Authentifizierung","Debuggen des Authentifizierungsstatus mit gh auth status zur Fehlerbehebung"],"pt":["Automatizar a criação de solicitações de pull com títulos e descrições personalizados","Configurar o git para usar o gh como um helper de credenciais para autenticação sem interrupções","Depurar o status de autenticação com o gh auth status para solução de problemas"],"ru":["Автоматизировать создание запросов на pulls с настраиваемыми заголовками и описаниями","Настроить git для использования gh в качестве помощника по учетным данным для бесшовной аутентификации","Отладить статус аутентификации с помощью gh auth status для устранения неполадок"],"ar":["تأتمتة إنشاء طلبات السحب مع عناوين ووصف مخصص","تكوين git لاستخدام gh كمساعد بيانات اعتماد من أجل مصادقة بدون انقطاع","تصحيح أخطاء حالة المصادقة باستخدام gh auth status من أجل حل المشكلات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitHub authentication and authorization","Dependent on Cosmian KMS for X.509 certificate lifecycle management"],"zh":["需要GitHub身份验证和授权","依赖于Cosmian KMS进行X.509证书生命周期管理"],"ja":["GitHubの認証と認可が必要","X.509証明書のライフサイクル管理のためにCosmian KMSに依存する"],"ko":["GitHub 인증 및 권한 부여가 필요합니다.","X.509 인증서 수명 주기 관리를 위해 Cosmian KMS에 의존합니다."],"es":["Requiere autenticación y autorización de GitHub","Dependiente de Cosmian KMS para la administración del ciclo de vida de certificados X.509"],"fr":["Nécessite une authentification et une autorisation GitHub","Dépend de Cosmian KMS pour la gestion du cycle de vie des certificats X.509"],"de":["Benötigt GitHub-Authentifizierung und -Autorisierung","Abhängig von Cosmian KMS für das Lebenszyklus-Management von X.509-Zertifikaten"],"pt":["Exige autenticação e autorização do GitHub","Dependente do Cosmian KMS para gerenciamento do ciclo de vida do certificado X.509"],"ru":["Требует аутентификации и авторизации GitHub","Зависит от Cosmian KMS для управления жизненным циклом сертификата X.509"],"ar":["يتطلب المصادقة والتصريح من GitHub","يعتمد على Cosmian KMS لإدارة دورة حياة شهادة X.509"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"51d1573e469220bbd79250684b2c365563d2ca864ef6550d1988196211084d3e","qualityScore":60}');
