das","Soporte para imágenes de referencia","Transferencia de estilo y consistencia de personajes","Instalación de un solo clic","Verificación de calidad y seguridad"],"fr":["Génération d''images personnalisées","Prise en charge des images de référence","Transfert de style et cohérence des personnages","Installation en un seul clic","Vérification de la qualité et de la sécurité"],"de":["Erstellung benutzerdefinierter Bilder","Unterstützung für Referenzbilder","Stilübertragung und Charakterkonsistenz","Ein-Klick-Installation","Qualitäts- und Sicherheitsprüfung"],"pt":["Geração de imagens personalizadas","Estilo de transferência para consistência de personagens","Suporte a imagens de referência","Código aberto e personalizável","Fácil de usar e integrar"],"ru":["Создание индивидуальных изображений","Стилевый перенос для последовательности персонажей","Поддержка ссылочных изображений","Открытое программное обеспечение и настраиваемое","Легко использовать и интегрировать"],"ar":["إِصطِناع الصُور المُتخصِصة","نَقْل الأَنماط لِتوحيد الشَخَصِيّات","دَعْم الصُور الإِشَارِية","بَرنامَج مفتوح المَصدر وَمُتَغَيِّر","سَهل الإِستِخدَام وَالتَضْمِين"]},"keywords":{"zh":["图像生成","Nano 图像生成器","参考图像","风格转换","一键式图像生成","高质量图像输出"],"ja":["画像生成","Nano 画像ジェネレーター","参考画像","スタイル転送","ワンクリック画像生成","高品質画像出力"],"ko":["이미지 생성","Nano 이미지 생성기","참조 이미지","스타일 전환","원클릭 이미지 생성","고화질 이미지 출력"],"es":["generador de imágenes","nano image generator","inteligencia artificial","procesamiento de imágenes","activos visuales","estilo de transferencia","consistencia de personajes"],"fr":["générateur d''images","nano image generator","intelligence artificielle","traitement d''images","actifs visuels","transfert de style","cohérence des personnages"],"de":["Bild-Generator","Nano-Bild-Generator","künstliche Intelligenz","Bildverarbeitung","visuelle Anforderungen","Stilübertragung","Charakterkonsistenz"],"pt":["gerador de imagens nano","criação de imagens personalizadas","estilo de transferência","consistência de personagens","código aberto","ferramenta de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Нано Генератор Изображений","создание индивидуальных изображений","стилевый перенос","последовательность персонажей","открытое программное обеспечение","инструмент разработки"],"ar":["مُولِد الصُور النانو","إِصطِناع الصُور المُتخصِصة","نَقْل الأَنماط","توحيد الشَخَصِيّات","بَرنامَج مفتوح المَصدر","أَداة تَطوِير"]}},"owner":"aiskillstore","repo":"marketplace","repoPath":"aiskillstore/marketplace","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.574Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"nano-image-generator","description":"Generate images using Nano Banana Pro (Gemini 3 Pro Preview). Use when creating app icons, logos, UI graphics, marketing banners, social media images, illustrations, diagrams, or any visual assets. Supports reference images for style transfer and character consistency. Triggers include phrases like generate an image, create a graphic, make an icon, design a logo, create a banner, same style as, keep the style, or any request needing visual content.","bodyPreview":"# Nano Image Generator\n\nGenerate images using Nano Banana Pro (Gemini 3 Pro Preview) for any visual asset needs. Supports **reference images** for style transfer and character consistency.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```bash\n# Basic generation\npython scripts/generate_image.py \"A friendly robot mascot waving\" --output ./mascot.png\n\n# With style reference (keep same visual style)\npython scripts/generate_image.py \"Same style, new content\" --ref ./reference.jpg --output ./new.png\n```\n\n## Script Usage\n\n```bash","body":"# Nano Image Generator\n\nGenerate images using Nano Banana Pro (Gemini 3 Pro Preview) for any visual asset needs. Supports **reference images** for style transfer and character consistency.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```bash\n# Basic generation\npython scripts/generate_image.py \"A friendly robot mascot waving\" --output ./mascot.png\n\n# With style reference (keep same visual style)\npython scripts/generate_image.py \"Same style, new content\" --ref ./reference.jpg --output ./new.png\n```\n\n## Script Usage\n\n```bash\npython scripts/generate_image.py <prompt> --output <path> [options]\n```\n\n**Required:**\n- `prompt` - Image description\n- `--output, -o` - Output file path\n\n**Options:**\n- `--aspect, -a` - Aspect ratio (default: `1:1`)\n  - Square: `1:1`\n  - Portrait: `2:3`, `3:4`, `4:5`, `9:16`\n  - Landscape: `3:2`, `4:3`, `5:4`, `16:9`, `21:9`\n- `--size, -s` - Resolution: `1K`, `2K` (default), `4K`\n- `--ref, -r` - Reference image (can use multiple times, max 14)\n\n## Reference Images\n\nGemini supports up to **14 reference images** for:\n\n### Style Transfer\nKeep the visual style (colors, textures, mood) from a reference:\n```bash\npython scripts/generate_image.py \"New scene with mountains, same visual style as reference\" \\\n  --ref ./style-reference.jpg --output ./styled-mountains.png\n```\n\n### Character Consistency\nMaintain character appearance across multiple images:\n```bash\npython scripts/generate_image.py \"Same character now in a forest setting\" \\\n  --ref ./character.png --output ./character-forest.png\n```\n\n### Multi-Image Fusion\nCombine elements from multiple references:\n```bash\npython scripts/generate_image.py \"Combine the style of first image with subject of second\" \\\n  --ref ./style.png --ref ./subject.png --output ./combined.png\n```\n\n### Serial Image Generation (Batch Workflow)\nFor generating a series with consistent style:\n1. Generate first image\n2. Use first image as `--ref` for subsequent images\n3. Each new image inherits the established style\n\n```bash\n# Generate cover\npython scripts/generate_image.py \"Tech knowledge card cover\" -o ./01-cover.png\n\n# Generate subsequent cards with style reference\npython scripts/generate_image.py \"Card 2 content, same style\" --ref ./01-cover.png -o ./02-card.png\npython scripts/generate_image.py \"Card 3 content, same style\" --ref ./01-cover.png -o ./03-card.png\n```\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. **Determine output location** - Place images where contextually appropriate:\n   - App icons → `./assets/icons/`\n   - Marketing → `./marketing/`\n   - UI elements → `./src/assets/`\n   - General → `./generated/`\n\n2. **Craft effective prompts** - Be specific and descriptive:\n   - Include style: \"flat design\", \"3D rendered\", \"watercolor\", \"minimalist\"\n   - Include context: \"for a mobile app\", \"website hero image\"\n   - Include details: colors, mood, composition\n   - For references: mention \"same style as reference\" or \"keep the visual style\"\n\n3. **Choose appropriate settings:**\n   - Icons/logos → `--aspect 1:1`\n   - Banners/headers → `--aspect 16:9` or `21:9`\n   - Mobile screens → `--aspect 9:16`\n   - Xiaohongshu cards → `--aspect 3:4`\n   - Photos → `--aspect 3:2` or `4:3`\n\n## Examples\n\n**App icon:**\n```bash\npython scripts/generate_image.py \"Minimalist flat design app icon of a lightning bolt, purple gradient background, modern iOS style\" \\\n  --output ./assets/app-icon.png --aspect 1:1\n```\n\n**Marketing banner:**\n```bash\npython scripts/generate_image.py \"Professional website hero banner for a productivity app, abstract geometric shapes, blue and white color scheme\" \\\n  --output ./public/images/hero-banner.png --aspect 16:9\n```\n\n**Xiaohongshu knowledge card:**\n```bash\npython scripts/generate_image.py \"Tech knowledge card, dark blue purple gradient, neon cyan accents, code block style, Chinese text ''标题''\" \\\n  --output ./xiaohongshu/card.png --aspect 3:4\n```\n\n**Style transfer:**\n```bash\npython scripts/generate_image.py \"Transform this photo into watercolor painting style\" \\\n  --ref ./photo.jpg --output ./watercolor.png\n```\n\n**Character in new scene:**\n```bash\npython scripts/generate_image.py \"Same character from reference, now sitting in a cafe, warm lighting\" \\\n  --ref ./character.png --output ./character-cafe.png --aspect 3:2\n```\n\n## Prompt Tips\n\n- **Be specific** - \"A red apple on a wooden table\" vs \"an apple\"\n- **Include style** - \"in the style of pixel art\" or \"photorealistic\"\n- **Mention purpose** - \"for a children''s book\" affects the output style\n- **Describe composition** - \"centered\", \"rule of thirds\", \"close-up\"\n- **Specify colors** - Explicit color palettes yield better results\n- **Reference prompts** - Use \"same style as reference\", \"keep the visual aesthetic\", \"match the color palette\"\n- **Avoid** - Don''t ask for complex text in images (use overlays instead)\n\n## Limitations\n\n- Maximum 14 reference images per request\n- Text rendering may be imperfect (better to overlay text separately)\n- Very specific brand logos may not reproduce exactly\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T04:34:41.383Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Visual Content Agents needing advanced image generation capabilities with style transfer and character consistency.","zh":"非常适合需要高级图像生成能力、风格转换和角色一致性的视觉内容代理","ja":"高度な画像生成機能、スタイル転送、キャラクターの一貫性が必要なビジュアルコンテンツエージェントに最適","ko":"고급 이미지 생성 기능, 스타일 전환 및 캐릭터 일관성이 필요한 시각적 컨텐츠 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de contenido visual que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de generación de imágenes con transferencia de estilo y consistencia de personajes.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de contenu visuel ayant besoin de capacités de génération d''images avancées avec transfert de style et cohérence de caractères.","de":"Perfekt für visuelle Inhaltsagenten, die erweiterte Bildgenerierungsfunktionen mit Stilübertragung und Charakterkonsistenz benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Conteúdo Visual que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de geração de imagens com transferência de estilo e consistência de personagens.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Визуальных Контент Агентов, нуждающихся в передовых возможностях генерации изображений с передачей стиля и последовательностью персонажей.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المحتوى البصري الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لإنشاء الصور بنقل الأسلوب والاتساق الشخصي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate high-quality images using Nano Banana Pro (Gemini 3 Pro Preview) with support for reference images, enabling style transfer and consistent visual assets through Python scripts and libraries.","zh":"通过支持参考图像、风格转换和一致的视觉资产的Nano Banana Pro（Gemini 3 Pro Preview）赋予代理生成高质量图像的能力，通过Python脚本和库实现","ja":"参考画像、スタイル転送、統一された視覚的資産をサポートするNano Banana Pro（Gemini 3 Pro Preview）を使用して、高品質の画像を生成するエージェントを可能にし、Pythonスクリプトとライブラリを介して実現","ko":"참조 이미지, 스타일 전환 및 일관된 시각적 자산을 지원하는 Nano Banana Pro(Gemini 3 Pro Preview)를 사용하여 에이전트가 고품질 이미지를 생성할 수 있도록 하며, Python 스크립트 및 라이브러리를 통해 구현","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar imágenes de alta calidad utilizando Nano Banana Pro (Vista previa de Gemini 3 Pro) con soporte para imágenes de referencia, lo que permite la transferencia de estilo y activos visuales consistentes a través de scripts y bibliotecas de Python.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des images de haute qualité en utilisant Nano Banana Pro (Aperçu de Gemini 3 Pro) avec une prise en charge d''images de référence, permettant ainsi le transfert de style et les actifs visuels cohérents via des scripts et des bibliothèques Python.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, hochwertige Bilder mit Nano Banana Pro (Vorschau von Gemini 3 Pro) zu generieren, mit Unterstützung für Referenzbilder, wodurch Stilübertragung und konsistente visuelle Assets durch Python-Skripte und -Bibliotheken ermöglicht werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar imagens de alta qualidade usando Nano Banana Pro (Gemini 3 Pro Preview) com suporte a imagens de referência, permitindo a transferência de estilo e ativos visuais consistentes por meio de scripts e bibliotecas Python.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать изображения высокого качества с помощью Nano Banana Pro (Gemini 3 Pro Preview) с поддержкой эталонных изображений, что позволяет передавать стиль и обеспечивать последовательность визуальных активов через скрипты и библиотеки Python.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من إنشاء صور عالية الجودة باستخدام Nano Banana Pro (Gemini 3 Pro Preview) مع دعم الصور المرجعية، مما يسمح بنقل الأسلوب والموارد البصرية المتسقة من خلال البرامج النصية ومكتبات Python."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating product images with consistent branding","Creating character mascots with style transfer","Automating visual content creation for social media"],"zh":["生成具有统一品牌的产品图像","创建具有风格转换的角色吉祥物","自动化社交媒体的视觉内容创建"],"ja":["統一されたブランドを持つ製品画像を生成する","スタイル転送を持つキャラクターマスコットを作成する","ソーシャルメディアの視覚的コンテンツの自動生成"],"ko":["统一 브랜드를 가진 제품 이미지를 생성","스타일 전환을 가진 캐릭터 마스코트를 생성","소셜 미디어를 위한 시각적 컨텐츠 자동 생성"],"es":["Generar imágenes de productos con marca consistente","Crear máscaras de personajes con transferencia de estilo","Automatizar la creación de contenido visual para redes sociales"],"fr":["Générer des images de produits avec une marque cohérente","Créer des mascottes de personnages avec transfert de style","Automatiser la création de contenu visuel pour les réseaux sociaux"],"de":["Generieren von Produktbildern mit konsistenter Markenidentität","Erstellen von Charaktermasken mit Stilübertragung","Automatisieren der Erstellung von visuellem Inhalt für soziale Medien"],"pt":["Geração de imagens de produtos com marcação consistente","Criação de mascotes de personagens com transferência de estilo","Automatização da criação de conteúdo visual para mídias sociais"],"ru":["Генерация изображений продуктов с последовательным брендингом","Создание персонажей-маскотов с передачей стиля","Автоматизация создания визуального контента для социальных сетей"],"ar":["إنشاء صور المنتجات مع العلامة التجارية المتسقة","إنشاء شخصيات الكرتون بنقل الأسلوب","آليّة إنشاء المحتوى البصري للمواقع الاجتماعية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python environment","Dependent on Nano Banana Pro (Gemini 3 Pro Preview) functionality"],"zh":["需要Python环境","依赖于Nano Banana Pro（Gemini 3 Pro Preview）的功能"],"ja":["Python環境が必要","Nano Banana Pro（Gemini 3 Pro Preview）の機能に依存"],"ko":["Python 환경이 필요","Nano Banana Pro(Gemini 3 Pro Preview)의 기능에 의존"],"es":["Requiere entorno de Python","Dependiente de la funcionalidad de Nano Banana Pro (Vista previa de Gemini 3 Pro)"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Python","Dépend de la fonctionnalité de Nano Banana Pro (Aperçu de Gemini 3 Pro)"],"de":["Benötigt Python-Umgebung","Abhängig von der Funktionalität von Nano Banana Pro (Vorschau von Gemini 3 Pro)"],"pt":["Requer ambiente Python","Dependente da funcionalidade do Nano Banana Pro (Gemini 3 Pro Preview)"],"ru":["Требуется среда Python","Зависит от функциональности Nano Banana Pro (Gemini 3 Pro Preview)"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة Python","يعتمد على وظيفة Nano Banana Pro (Gemini 3 Pro Preview)"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"98f1a81711128b63b212c3483bc346a2318cd227f57229015517b462a9c8a5e8","qualityScore":60}');
